.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-163 BREAKING route all files through esbuild-loader; remove babel (#194)\n\nWELL IT''S ABOUT TIME\n\nPurge babel, which is little more than removing related deps in\n`package.json` and then routing all files through `esbuild-loader`. Most\nof the work will be downstream, largely grouped into three categories:\n1. Refactor tests that leveraged imports from `@bigtest/interactor`.\n  That package used an experimental decorator syntax that `esbuild` does\n  not support. This was the original reason behind STRWEB-78 / PR #101\n  when this split was introduced.\n2. Migrate to oxlint from eslint. oxlint is independent of\n  stripes-webpack.\n3. Migrate to jest v30. Our jest v30 config is independent of\n  stripes-webpack, leveraging @swc/jest instead.\n\nRefs STRWEB-163","tree":{"sha":"391cf84b4d4b0c3e549aead26666d1ff8dfd1e5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/391cf84b4d4b0c3e549aead26666d1ff8dfd1e5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/914848381a834033cf1b215e08f521a6fa945a39","verification":{"payload":"tree 391cf84b4d4b0c3e549aead26666d1ff8dfd1e5e\nparent ec9f0161217cb006f889334d2b0cf9581ab4426b\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1791367146 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791367146 -0400\n\nSTRWEB-163 BREAKING route all files through esbuild-loader; remove babel (#194)\n\nWELL IT''S ABOUT TIME\n\nPurge babel, which is little more than removing related deps in\n`package.json` and then routing all files through `esbuild-loader`. Most\nof the work will be downstream, largely grouped into three categories:\n1. Refactor tests that leveraged imports from `@bigtest/interactor`.\n  That package used an experimental decorator syntax that `esbuild` does\n  not support. This was the original reason behind STRWEB-78 / PR #101\n  when this split was introduced.\n2. Migrate to oxlint from eslint. oxlint is independent of\n  stripes-webpack.\n3. Migrate 