ccbb59743f37cea2e9a857db6f66b1ac12b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/896cccbb59743f37cea2e9a857db6f66b1ac12b3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/533612?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/julianladisch","id":533612,"login":"julianladisch","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzMzYxMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julianladisch","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/8eb1cff2e0a52b33770aa7110ba3158a74243254/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:09:27Z","email":"533612+julianladisch@users.noreply.github.com","name":"julianladisch"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:09:27Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-159: @module-federation/enhanced ^2.8.1 removing axios (#191)\n\nhttps://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STRWEB-159\n\nUpgrade @module-federation/enhanced from ^2.0.0 to ^2.8.1 in\npackage.json.\n\nstripes-webpack’s yarn.lock has this axios dependency path:\n\n* @module-federation/enhanced@2.3.1 › @module-federation/cli@2.3.1 ›\n@module-federation/dts-plugin@2.3.1 › axios@1.13.5\n\nIn recent @module-federation/enhanced versions the axios dependency has\nbeen completely removed:\nhttps://github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4644\n\nThere are multiple known security vulnerabilities in axios@1.13.5 – 3\nsevere, 7 high, 21 medium:\nhttps://security.snyk.io/package/npm/axios/1.13.5\n\nAfter the change in stripes-webpack’s package.json has been made and\nsome other module bumps the stripes-webpack version then yarn will\nautomatically remove this axios dependency from the other module’s\nyarn.lock file.\n\nThis helps the FOLIO Security Team triaging whether FOLIO is affected by\naxios security vulnerabilities, and gives implementers more confidence\nthat FOLIO is secure.\n\nThe snapshot reference environments run with\n@module-federation/enhanced@2.8.1:\nhttps://github.com/folio-org/platform-lsp/blob/snapshot/yarn.lock\n\nTo keep stripes-webpack developer environments in sync with the snapshot\nreference environments we should update stripes-webpack’s yarn.lock file\nfrom time to time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julian Ladisch <julianladisch@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c93c979e7cf19300be72f666b628e2eeed4df8b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/c93c979e7cf19300be72f666b628e2eeed4df8b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/8eb1cff2e0a52b33770aa7110ba3158a74243254","verification":{"payload":"tree c93c979e7cf19300be72f666b628e2eeed4df8b6\nparent 6a00291a266c9e581523de24d56ac2ecda6462d1\nauthor julianladisch <533612+julianladisch@users.noreply.github.com> 1785766167 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785766167 +0200\n\nSTRWEB-159: @module-federation/enhanced ^2.8.1 removing axios (#191)\n\nhttps://folio-org.atlassian.net/browse/STRWEB-159\n\nUpgrade @module-federation/enhanced from ^2.0.0 to ^2.8.1 in\npackage.json.\n\nstripes-webpack’s yarn.lock has this axios dependency path:\n\n* @module-federation/enhanced@2.3.1 › @module-federation/cli@2.3.1 ›\n@module-federation/dts-plugin@2.3.1 › axios@1.13.5\n\nIn recent @module-federation/enhanced versions the axios dependency has\nbeen completely removed:\nhttps://github.com/module-federation/core/pull/4644\n\nThere are multiple known security vulnerabilities in axios@1.13.5 – 3\nsevere, 7 high, 21 medium:\nhttps://security.snyk.io/package/npm/axios/1.13.5\n\nAfter the change in stripes-webpack’s package.json has been made and\nsome other module bumps the stripes-webpack version then yarn will\nautomatically remove this axios dependency from the other module’s\nyarn.lock file.\n\nThis helps the FOLIO Security Team triaging whether FOLIO is affected by\naxios security vulnerabilities, and gives implementers more confidence\nthat FOLIO is secure.\n\nThe snapshot reference environments run with\n@module-federation/enhanced@2.8.1:\nhttps://github.com/folio-org/platform-lsp/blob/snapshot/yarn.lock\n\nTo keep stripes-webpack developer environments in sync with the snapshot\nreference environments we should update stripes-webpack’s yarn.lock file\nfrom time to time.\n\nCo-authored-by: Julian Ladisch <julianladisch@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcKEXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQgEQAGhWpND7CScRaRRoMz8Sim9P\nYZKdbBW/dCnmNmhUq3cGf9qV7dJX0oOfwU4APJ65Tj46TImVoxgKJZf94z15aV6J\nFrmBuOa4yxX9Te/fjVxeoiGkxLZYvqUFd/h0OcdhFf6nrdlupIq1RfeFswI25eK6\nHgjNT0mSYJ0rSFv6Y2xsBx+DPkoxttw9jv25xfKnyykYAi0+teLemAp9S9B+zolp\nWHW5YPaJPfkaqZUZUw/4iqw7tt/ND9V+iBZEH9PDGB2say5/HbzvdRE/D31HCBpj\nzK2iANyGGvnU68URqDLbzYsZD9Ab8hW+7Znv/vRaACuPMm9qTq5pWvy5QjME5Mlz\ndsQLy7VrWqDAHP0f3/eCxg9QIaYG/8KIgPfhCTi88Lx6a1/iibTu6qTU19U7ZuZK\nQ9kdCisNtsriDV+emug0oyb4dSdLvSQhxpk0ek5LLpnNf8RDW2IqATA8cbmiVrye\nfy5DAXsErdHK2IDVIZh1kUyfsfq4Ox4FeTHKIuLVSnzFl05ImSaBXDMxdEoKN243\nsTXczfGv1edTmgN9E50Pa1k05qj06Liue7faIfp9sMs06xo8YK6mss0nydGh+xuS\nkqysRLq5d7qmDYURKpzSEBbxlcqb1abdhOW1m6lO2TZmTVmQxnT6JKFV/DShF2rp\n6MAGN5KglWNS8zC8q6bf\n=8DGq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-03T14:09:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av