hub.com/users/zburke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/7c33cdb0684b356791f77d09a383d187f3b551a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T21:05:45Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T21:05:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-148, STRWEB-152 *BREAKING* bump serialize-javascript, webpack-copy-plugin (#183)\n\n* BREAKING drop support for `engines.node` < v22\n* bump `serialize-javascript` to v7\n* bump `copy-webpack-plugin` to v14\n\n`serialize-javascript` v6 contains unpatched security vulnerabilities\n(CVE-2020-7660 and CVE-2026-34043). `serialize-javascript` v7 patches\nthose vulnerabilities, but requires raising `engines.node` to at least\nv20. We are taking advantage of the moment to raise the minimum\nsupported version all the way to v22. v20 will become unsupported in a\nfew weeks, and raising the minimum version as high as possible now\nhopefully makes it more likely that we can absorb future changes to\nthird-party packages without another version bump due to `engines.node`\nincompatibility.\n\nRefs STRWEB-148, STRWEB-152","tree":{"sha":"9c065b8af86007e526baaa7195fec7a97fd77910","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/9c065b8af86007e526baaa7195fec7a97fd77910"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/7c33cdb0684b356791f77d09a383d187f3b551a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 9c065b8af86007e526baaa7195fec7a97fd77910\nparent c59cd5751a26c56623480c3786030f9ccb91c8b0\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1775682345 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1775682345 -0400\n\nSTRWEB-148, STRWEB-152 *BREAKING* bump serialize-javascript, webpack-copy-plugin (#183)\n\n* BREAKING drop support for `engines.node` < v22\n* bump `serialize-javascript` to v7\n* bump `copy-webpack-plugin` to v14\n\n`serialize-javascript` v6 contains unpatched security vulnerabilities\n(CVE-2020-7660 and CVE-2026-34043). `serialize-javascript` v7 patches\nthose vulnerabilities, but requires raising `engines.node` to at least\nv20. We are taking advantage of the moment to raise the minimum\nsupported version all the way to v22. v20 will become unsupported in a\nfew weeks, and raising the minimum version as high as possible now\nhopefully makes it more likely that we can absorb future changes to\nthird-party packages without another version bump due to `engines.node`\nincompatibility.\n\nRefs STRWEB-148, STRWEB-152","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp1sMqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgAcQAHg7vfI6hcQAMOhHljI6ev+F\nRUFFSLrrYpkFMeBDZxuG6EvY1lS5hFdmtsxDOp9zH5DvOlW2kLbBHZ6CQnLbBp05\nnHRnxRSHSpUEDR5bK+sxJdAPOcFz7aqXZWsbn59t7tRqNMR/WUfp5j2EkGun1fVe\nrFITG68cwetM0u1vGMCg6duKZk8luAmOhfInjGYFJwA+Umldxf4nEyNt5jB/+5XD\nadMuaaxEv/ha9SBT0jgoK1DppAyS/eib2hkiMw9l94UJ33tkeHBeVLwv9isFL287\nQ0jqqaisDwWbLqHEVXl4TYrQB2MzqN30hTHUUQtrnIdJJ43ZPppdpIOxTn1ahY/t\nt6/bIhAUOhAYbwQVmi40I+8VumWgz7vNHRZWTYy2QmKgAjJ85aWaVFDFeuHhaRno\npHlKTZaaNdLP71HHqarGS5UqyHsHvzEcsI+YUJNz2khRtRDWuH8MQmM4LKdlt2Ms\nFR+ERUNKV2BhyJjUr17cU9We5mqkZvD41bEcN8TOqYO/vvOQYEN7TPOg+OrPHZtD\nYq19vtAQxDyc5ufaIC5sjaqaIABafDtWZlkfTxALb1hqyWAvDYGA0gxR8/6qrI4f\nL39fa96aAeAnP0EfosHyrGTbCvpO5ioUbEvLhu6G1vFXF4MnufucR3fHoQnb+BF/\nPXd100gfPuQXEBlSk5TJ\n=MNJR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-08T21:05:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_ur