f74d8189adf5323199dcd220b0525583888e817","sha":"df74d8189adf5323199dcd220b0525583888e817","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/df74d8189adf5323199dcd220b0525583888e817"}],"sha":"caf5aff321efa0f143e80372d510f2584a3da951","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/caf5aff321efa0f143e80372d510f2584a3da951"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20704067?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JohnC-80","id":20704067,"login":"JohnC-80","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzA0MDY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/df74d8189adf5323199dcd220b0525583888e817/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-31T19:24:01Z","email":"jcoburn@ebsco.com","name":"John Coburn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-31T19:24:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-139 Use non-webpack module federation plugin. (#176)\n\n* STRIPES-861: Setup module federation\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* cleanup\n\n* Use shutdown hook\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Add required version to shared singletons\n\n* Start remotes automatically\n\n* Expose icons via public endpoint\n\n* react-query provides a context, so must be a singleton\n\n* STCOR-726 map sounds directory for remote applications\n\n* map the `sounds` directory for remote applications, analogous to how\n  translations and icons are served\n* provide `/code` to make the registry human-readable\n* catch and display startup errors in case humans make stupid coding\n  mistakes and need help finding them\n\n* current versions\n\n* separate handling of stripes-components and application icons\n\nIcons in stripes-components are imported as components whereas those in\napplications are just resources, so we need to load them differently.\n\n* provide registry url in stripes-config\n\n* collect translations from ''StripesDeps'' modules in built translations\n\n* get the app''s main entry from package.json\n\n* ensure there are aliases before member access\n\n* expand the singletons for the platform\n\n* migrate  mf plugin/libraries to @module-federation/enhanced\n\n* bump webpack-dev-server version\n\n* restore stripes-config-plugin from main\n\n* turn off hot reloading in module-level dev server\n\n* turn off hot reloading in devtools for now\n\n* use default discoveryUrl for local\n\n* fussing with attempting to override shares with host dependencies\n\n* re-add test folder\n\n* sync with STCOR STRWEB-139 changes\n\n* add runtimePlugin for host override\n\n* remove auto version from modules\n\n* single runtime from host\n\n* set external runtime to true for modules\n\n* exclude host-shares from module bundle\n\n* add further optimization to module bundle, remove runtime plugins\n\n* add remote runtime plugin to absorb plugins of host at runtime\n\n* push host plugins to remote runtime\n\n* collect debug info, cleanup logging in runtime plugins\n\n* rename stripes runtime host plugin, tests\n\n* remove the junky test artifacts\n\n* consolidate modfed configs to a single file. Add semver to runtime plugin dep check\n\n* tweak comments, remove the axios dep\n\n* prefer spread syntax in cli configs. Alphabetize config values in mod-fed-config\n\n* shore up the runtime logic with some optional chaining\n\n* use default discoveryUrl for platform host app ''serve'' command\n\n* add console messaging for build command\n\n* re-add manifest plugin\n\n* address sonar-dad concerns\n\n* minor: whtspace\n\n* rework no-config discoverUrl use in serve.js\n\n* remove all references to defaultTenant entry\n\n* config: concatenateModules: false\n\n* if no config discoveryUrl provided in config file, inject the default discoveryConfig if the --federate flag is used.\n\n* re-add splitChunks to bundle in order to include dayJS chunks in main bundles\n\n* resolve failures with mf-runtime-plugin tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michal Kuklis <michal.kuklis@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f12b95ac8fe05def7cecf55d6499ba57f655880","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/9f12b95ac8fe05def7cecf55d6499ba57f655880"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/df74d8189adf5323199dcd220b0525583888e817","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f12b95ac8fe05def7cecf55d6499ba57f655880\nparent c50db54bd4039a07bc00332f5940c901e5b6e0ad\nauthor John Coburn <jcoburn@ebsco.com> 1774985041 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774985041 -0500\n\nSTRWEB-139 Use non-webpack module federation plugin. (#176)\n\n* STRIPES-861: Setup module federation\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* cleanup\n\n* Use shutdown hook\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Add required version to shared singletons\n\n* Start remotes automatically\n\n* Expose icons via public endpoint\n\n* react-query provides a context, so must be a singleton\n\n* STCOR-726 map sounds directory for remote applications\n\n* map the `sounds` directory for remote applications, analogous to how\n  translations and icons are served\n* provide `/code` to make the registry human-readable\n* catch and display startup errors in case humans make stupid coding\n  mistakes and need help finding them\n\n* current versions\n\n* separate handling of stripes-components and application icons\n\nIcons in stripes-components are imported as components whereas those in\napplications are just resources, so we need to load them differently.\n\n* provide registry url in stripes-config\n\n* collect translations from ''StripesDeps'' modules in built translations\n\n* get the app''s main entry from package.json\n\n* ensure there are aliases before member access\n\n* expand the singletons for the platform\n\n* migrate  mf plugin/libraries to @module-federation/enhanced\n\n* bump webpack-dev-server version\n\n* restore stripes-config-plugin from main\n\n* turn off hot reloading in module-level dev server\n\n* turn off hot reloading in devtools for now\n\n* use default discoveryUrl for local\n\n* fussing with attempting to override shares with host dependencies\n\n* re-add test folder\n\n* sync with STCOR STRWEB-139 changes\n\n* add runtimePlugin for host override\n\n* remove auto version from modules\n\n* single runtime from host\n\n* set external runtime to true for modules\n\n* exclude host-shares from module bundle\n\n* add further optimization to module bundle, remove runtime plugins\n\n* add remote runtime plugin to absorb plugins of host at runtime\n\n* push host plugins to remote runtime\n\n* collect debug info, cleanup logging in runtime plugins\n\n* rename stripes runtime host plugin, tests\n\n* remove the junky test artifacts\n\n* consolidate modfed configs to a single file. Add semver to runtime plugin dep check\n\n* tweak comments, remove the axios dep\n\n* prefer spread syntax in cli configs. Alphabetize config values in mod-fed-config\n\n* shore up the runtime logic with some optional chaining\n\n* use default discoveryUrl for platform host app ''serve'' command\n\n* add console messaging for build command\n\n* re-add manifest plugin\n\n* address sonar-dad concerns\n\n* minor: whtspace\n\n* rework no-config discoverUrl use in serve.js\n\n* remove all references to defaultTenant entry\n\n* config: concatenateModules: false\n\n* if no config discoveryUrl provided in config file, inject the default discoveryConfig if the --federate flag is used.\n\n* re-add splitChunks to bundle in order to include dayJS chunks in main bundles\n\n* resolve failures with mf-runtime-plugin tests\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michal Kuklis <michal.kuklis@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpzB9RCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkZQQAEH6MJ/Tzn5xBclxBtEQ4fY0\nkqE13UFnyahzUM332vGXit46f+SFF7MWv8/b8eQny0vV33SB0jmiP1Z5BOFlZvZX\nW2ncOXfHIsTr9k9jJ/wJdib1MD5h6cDZqroQS/yv4hSk1mc7vRQQiJBtzZR9fEjn\noQb4MmVlupj2cyrQcxorMzw+8f+v0A08IdBKACxPKqBr1gffyY8Br8uEOQY9Y0y6\nHWKvz+zFFE2oPYxBdEun83DUrRTizuPrOIszeAffPXao3gZEZtmyOhW2eUxMpy5a\nIpGR5wzET3Q5aP9EeUFMH00kpydhRx/rIRenbB3EjaThOzapQ/UvZRWFrDTMdBnt\nE6uf6Mm4j+g+o5mQnC4AUIqPMk19nH5xott3nJjLNcBTZ665Xr/7u87EZkAg//W1\ngyC46Q86Bu1ZiUyKOce9bSJOVEP+iRT2n6Zv7NXOdJ1Gaxlclli+EUnT+rbUifIb\n9NMWITmtuwXga/1KwB85Whaf7Y9ZcCLMR65Kn2/eib7WDrwW7uOfTnTanj6DpG2Q\nYE3Ymm3XeEXV+ET2+WK/R82/8IpiRW5SVMNPrlJBLPq1F2NbqjWvk4dv1sKtm3Qa\nO7UDW03QnpBkzNA8QImg0542+DF9eJosev2p+p9sGzHG7D8/odlfAxgiKm3Ui48G\nOg3lYkJSRa6ad0KGIiGH\n=oNbN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-03-31T19:24:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web