com/JohnC-80","id":20704067,"login":"JohnC-80","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwNzA0MDY3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JohnC-80","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/2ddd418dd00fb7fbc33b7972c93fcd109e40a5aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T22:51:57Z","email":"jcoburn@ebsco.com","name":"John Coburn"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T22:51:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRIPES-861 integration of module federation logic in the main branch. (#173)\n\n* STRIPES-861: Setup module federation\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* cleanup\n\n* Use shutdown hook\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Add required version to shared singletons\n\n* Start remotes automatically\n\n* Expose icons via public endpoint\n\n* react-query provides a context, so must be a singleton\n\n* STCOR-726 map sounds directory for remote applications\n\n* map the `sounds` directory for remote applications, analogous to how\n  translations and icons are served\n* provide `/code` to make the registry human-readable\n* catch and display startup errors in case humans make stupid coding\n  mistakes and need help finding them\n\n* current versions\n\n* separate handling of stripes-components and application icons\n\nIcons in stripes-components are imported as components whereas those in\napplications are just resources, so we need to load them differently.\n\n* provide registry url in stripes-config\n\n* collect translations from ''StripesDeps'' modules in built translations\n\n* get the app''s main entry from package.json\n\n* ensure there are aliases before member access\n\n* expand the singletons for the platform\n\n* make module-federation opt-in via stripes-config\n\n* sync up stripes-config-plugin\n\n* tweak local federation commands\n\n* switch back to spawn vs spawnsync\n\n* update to current vm expected exports\n\n* put back inclusion of stripes-deps in the main stripes-translation plugin, StripesConfig logic\n\n* add tests for StripesTranslationPlugin federate mode\n\n* use base webpack config from main branch\n\n* add comment to top of federate remote webpack config\n\n* log changes\n\n* log more changes\n\n* add loader entry for sound file\n\n* remove StripesLocalFederationPlugin\n\n* remove commented svg rules in federate config\n\n* remove axios\n\n* high level comments and mod-fed vs monolithic translation differences\n\n* dynamically fetch versions for platform singletons\n\n* configure for module-federation with --federate flag on build and serve commands\n\n* clean and comment edit\n\n* buildConfig is now async\n\n* remove async fallback for platform singletons\n\n* shape dev registry response closer to actual entitlement response\n\n* remove the await for buildConfig\n\n* add tenant name to registry server for spoofing the metadata endpoint\n\n* look in same folder for module-level builds\n\n* const/let in stripes-translations-plugin, ts loader rules in federate webpack config\n\n* add extensions to resolve in federate webpack config\n\n* add more ''include'' paths for module-level builds\n\n* clean up catches\n\n* add rxjs/operators to singletons list\n\n* add tests for federate function, remove portfinder dep\n\n* bountiful comments.\n\n* export casing on defaultEntitlementUrl\n\n* console output, test tweaks\n\n* remove commented code from tests\n\n* clean up security concerns with cors and local servers\n\n* clean up async keyword\n\n* leaving cors open for now\n\n* s/entitlementUrl/discoveryUrl/g\n\n* s/entitlementUrl/discoveryUrl/g in tests, too, duh\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michal Kuklis <michal.kuklis@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ff15a9bd9610089ee894dd0100b609d2bd9fdf4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/1ff15a9bd9610089ee894dd0100b609d2bd9fdf4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/2ddd418dd00fb7fbc33b7972c93fcd109e40a5aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ff15a9bd9610089ee894dd0100b609d2bd9fdf4\nparent d7cb74e67f812a18f5edd8a78f06a93629472d30\nauthor John Coburn <jcoburn@ebsco.com> 1770159117 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770159117 -0600\n\nSTRIPES-861 integration of module federation logic in the main branch. (#173)\n\n* STRIPES-861: Setup module federation\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* cleanup\n\n* Use shutdown hook\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Cleanup\n\n* Add required version to shared singletons\n\n* Start remotes automatically\n\n* Expose icons via public endpoint\n\n* react-query provides a context, so must be a singleton\n\n* STCOR-726 map sounds directory for remote applications\n\n* map the `sounds` directory for remote applications, analogous to how\n  translations and icons are served\n* provide `/code` to make the registry human-readable\n* catch and display startup errors in case humans make stupid coding\n  mistakes and need help finding them\n\n* current versions\n\n* separate handling of stripes-components and application icons\n\nIcons in stripes-components are imported as components whereas those in\napplications are just resources, so we need to load them differently.\n\n* provide registry url in stripes-config\n\n* collect translations from ''StripesDeps'' modules in built translations\n\n* get the app''s main entry from package.json\n\n* ensure there are aliases before member access\n\n* expand the singletons for the platform\n\n* make module-federation opt-in via stripes-config\n\n* sync up stripes-config-plugin\n\n* tweak local federation commands\n\n* switch back to spawn vs spawnsync\n\n* update to current vm expected exports\n\n* put back inclusion of stripes-deps in the main stripes-translation plugin, StripesConfig logic\n\n* add tests for StripesTranslationPlugin federate mode\n\n* use base webpack config from main branch\n\n* add comment to top of federate remote webpack config\n\n* log changes\n\n* log more changes\n\n* add loader entry for sound file\n\n* remove StripesLocalFederationPlugin\n\n* remove commented svg rules in federate config\n\n* remove axios\n\n* high level comments and mod-fed vs monolithic translation differences\n\n* dynamically fetch versions for platform singletons\n\n* configure for module-federation with --federate flag on build and serve commands\n\n* clean and comment edit\n\n* buildConfig is now async\n\n* remove async fallback for platform singletons\n\n* shape dev registry response closer to actual entitlement response\n\n* remove the await for buildConfig\n\n* add tenant name to registry server for spoofing the metadata endpoint\n\n* look in same folder for module-level builds\n\n* const/let in stripes-translations-plugin, ts loader rules in federate webpack config\n\n* add extensions to resolve in federate webpack config\n\n* add more ''include'' paths for module-level builds\n\n* clean up catches\n\n* add rxjs/operators to singletons list\n\n* add tests for federate function, remove portfinder dep\n\n* bountiful comments.\n\n* export casing on defaultEntitlementUrl\n\n* console output, test tweaks\n\n* remove commented code from tests\n\n* clean up security concerns with cors and local servers\n\n* clean up async keyword\n\n* leaving cors open for now\n\n* s/entitlementUrl/discoveryUrl/g\n\n* s/entitlementUrl/discoveryUrl/g in tests, too, duh\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Michal Kuklis <michal.kuklis@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpgnwNCRC1aQ7