her_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zburke","id":199241,"login":"zburke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTI0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/0ef62730295f7376e5d20406745526b13e2e18e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-09T13:02:19Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-09T13:02:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-142 optional code-splitting with async module-loading functions (#171)\n\nSummary\n\nOptionally implement code-splitting, supplying async module-loading\nfunctions with dynamic `import()`.\n\nDetails\n\n* Given the CLI flag `--lazy`, split the bundle into per-module chunks.\n* In the virtual module `stripes-config`:\n  * set `config.isLazy = true;`\n  * for each module, supply an async module-loader function,\n    `getDynamicModule()`, in place of the sync `getModule()` function\n    provided in a monolithic bundle\n* See also STCOR-1014 / https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/pull/1673\n\nRefs STRWEB-137, STRIPES-999, STRWEB-142","tree":{"sha":"39075d84742bacf47ca19caed47ea148eb0e867d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/39075d84742bacf47ca19caed47ea148eb0e867d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/0ef62730295f7376e5d20406745526b13e2e18e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 39075d84742bacf47ca19caed47ea148eb0e867d\nparent 9c2ebc4c758d266885e06b076f8f3187f4609770\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1765285339 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1765285339 -0500\n\nSTRWEB-142 optional code-splitting with async module-loading functions (#171)\n\nSummary\n\nOptionally implement code-splitting, supplying async module-loading\nfunctions with dynamic `import()`.\n\nDetails\n\n* Given the CLI flag `--lazy`, split the bundle into per-module chunks.\n* In the virtual module `stripes-config`:\n  * set `config.isLazy = true;`\n  * for each module, supply an async module-loader function,\n    `getDynamicModule()`, in place of the sync `getModule()` function\n    provided in a monolithic bundle\n* See also STCOR-1014 / https://github.com/folio-org/stripes-core/pull/1673\n\nRefs STRWEB-137, STRIPES-999, STRWEB-142","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpOB3bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA31kQAHSfx0leBLVCp9WUJdVImlDc\nmlJLj7Bn9WvLLYUXitp5R28qOWlHXMdf3OVdS6/HZFS8hf/eLk+nHd2bDj+l7Vcp\ndfAYLrLGLVzTNyzYlm0JW/wCIKFFBeEb70I547bKDu4XvCl0X9TOaCi8LjEFeNxY\nTQcqGvMmpXIzrovuEsqcoRFi6ZCR2b1COs2C2I7m5oxh1k1gklDnRZjUBnn92BlN\nB91+4Mrws/JFdxajQY+Nw9p1kk09pyLuJfGQsWzL3+7k/AOcHrbX9N2DvdQWJHNX\nO3wpE9HqoTxyIedwcmHRKJI3stD0eM4ALZiMX6XA+eTpKGXfiE6/OJlGcGGqzx9k\n9E50e+lQ+e2MZGsiHrb1kuRVVTIFrcmArq/L6+aJoanmyisgXfvxsMzYtLa+CYz2\nzt0Nt4Y8aD5YCOMCp2t2U+2WKc6VUQE5P6K6npfH3wzzF/0O+TfTFs3jqNy49Sgl\ncyr5fCoT+PEJtakYpNYJH7NH77g17udgo+nB05WetkWcCPS49AOoOpDj+5/bNPOK\nvL+aZ6qJVDUJ4pd2NajkPQ09b9kohX4r9Si7uvHacDsPDCEFZ2TP0rCtPDpi3kwo\nsQcryxJLIBhj8wlNs2rgfhrdXQFTG539PERulX9L2TJ1VlsFZKjPxCQQxZOCL7SM\nc4m53cNZuqBWr7SJqUxa\n=fBcS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-09T13:02:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/othe