.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/9c2ebc4c758d266885e06b076f8f3187f4609770/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-05T18:53:38Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T18:53:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-137 lazy-loading special case for handlers (#170)\n\n**sigh lazy and static methods don''t play nice together :sob: Without\nthis change in place, modules with handlers never get loaded. It isn''t\nclear if we just don''t have things configured correctly, or if there is\na fundamental incompatibility between the way we implemented\nhandler-modules and the way React implemented lazy.\n\nRefs STRWEB-137","tree":{"sha":"99d921976a1a1e84c0e9543e6615a5159e167e14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/99d921976a1a1e84c0e9543e6615a5159e167e14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/9c2ebc4c758d266885e06b076f8f3187f4609770","verification":{"payload":"tree 99d921976a1a1e84c0e9543e6615a5159e167e14\nparent a5e2567ca9be30dfc5eee5a2befb03d8f40479fb\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1762368818 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1762368818 -0500\n\nSTRWEB-137 lazy-loading special case for handlers (#170)\n\n**sigh lazy and static methods don''t play nice together :sob: Without\nthis change in place, modules with handlers never get loaded. It isn''t\nclear if we just don''t have things configured correctly, or if there is\na fundamental incompatibility between the way we implemented\nhandler-modules and the way React implemented lazy.\n\nRefs STRWEB-137","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpC50yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAr