ebpack/commit/a5e2567ca9be30dfc5eee5a2befb03d8f40479fb","sha":"a5e2567ca9be30dfc5eee5a2befb03d8f40479fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/a5e2567ca9be30dfc5eee5a2befb03d8f40479fb"}],"sha":"9c2ebc4c758d266885e06b076f8f3187f4609770","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/9c2ebc4c758d266885e06b076f8f3187f4609770"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zburke","id":199241,"login":"zburke","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTI0MQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zburke","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/commits/a5e2567ca9be30dfc5eee5a2befb03d8f40479fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-03T21:51:09Z","email":"zburke@ebsco.com","name":"Zak Burke"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-03T21:51:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"STRWEB-137 _correctly_ implement lazy loading (#169)\n\nRefactor the lazy loading implementation by lifting the dynamic import\nstatements out of the `module.getModule()` functions, which are called\nfrom inside stripes-core''s AppRoutes component, up to the top level of\nthe `stripes-config` virtual module. Implement `getModule()` as a\ndead-simple function that directly returns the lazy-loaded module\nprovided in that top-level declaration.\n\nBackstory\n\nPR #168 introduced lazy loading but implemented it in a way that\ndirectly contradicted Very Specific Guidance from https://react.dev,\nnamely:\n\n> Do not declare lazy components inside other components.\n> Instead, always declare them at the top level of your module.\n\nTop-level application components, loaded and rendered only once by\nstripes-core in AppRoutes, would work fine. Plugins, however, do not\nhave routes and would be rendered multiple times, directly causing\nSTCOR-1008 and STCOR-1009.\n\nRefs STRWEB-137, STCOR-1008, STCOR-1009, FOLIO-4392","tree":{"sha":"1ced1eabce2f11210991a4ac768c465fd656fe4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/1ced1eabce2f11210991a4ac768c465fd656fe4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/a5e2567ca9be30dfc5eee5a2befb03d8f40479fb","verification":{"payload":"tree 1ced1eabce2f11210991a4ac768c465fd656fe4d\nparent 275366dd96ff75d12111ab67c8635c69d64d464e\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1762206669 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1762206669 -0500\n\nSTRWEB-137 _correctly_ implement lazy loading (#169)\n\nRefactor the lazy loading implementation by lifting the dynamic import\nstatements out of the `module.getModule()` functions, which are called\nfrom inside stripes-core''s AppRoutes component, up to the top level of\nthe `stripes-config` virtual module. Implement `getModule()` as a\ndead-simple function that directly returns the lazy-loaded module\nprovided in that top-level declaration.\n\nBackstory\n\nPR #168 introduced lazy loading but implemented it in a way that\ndirectly contradicted Very Specific Guidance from https://react.dev,\nnamely:\n\n> Do not declare lazy components inside other components.\n> Instead, always declare them at the top level of your module.\n\nTop-level application components, loaded and rendered only once by\nstripes-core in AppRoutes, would work fine. Plugins, however, do not\nhave routes and would be rendered multiple times, directly causing\nSTCOR-1008 and STCOR-1009.\n\nRefs STRWEB-137, STCOR-1008, STCOR-1009, FOLIO-4392","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpCSPNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgn0QAKGA0hW/96YyNBgfsF3dUCY2\nbrkQ+VvMxE1nFmwZF0H0JVyrUL4qg8Jwqzhihsq0Vi2L6IBa5G3QvGnGTHtt/4a6\nwBVL8ybKcMWvyhHrgbG1CDZwERDkDEWFjIyBmx8dF/Wx986j5GISPhnA0Kb66yr3\nGA5jLPcP5kT12QkvNjiPSUeF3EtCL1qnpWJVSZNIK5DMMTMqMC1ytwTy5+jaj3Bd\n3ku4bOR531CE8yVsqa7PKVAFnCk0XCgKazI0t5Bq5oEiusJcC3sf9E8RYuecieG8\nlyGMq211v3g9zsJTXmAEY9ZCrPbxBLbQsI9lptYMMvbca8/aNmB3XaaWVniTyx3E\nQXRKlModubwA78qp7uqwazOWBi1uY0jKbnFESP1Uc0EIA4qbkrI+Oj/RfTGaRcs5\ncIOtMCPkDlqRq5iy5ivbxqMbboMWjhu9atYW1ZFohS+B0hRinZUwpzyM0df45fUZ\n8GAPLSM0bZARmBTzEIjkzeQbOiSMKNBzqdR2Wb/EejHzOReljPVJiv4yKmi4T5nj\nfJeT5wQparA+7Ths+ccn+finGZPFrmYz20pW347kDza0WieQ+ql5sYV4EgKp89XF\ni1YzoI8SAhplmy48RNfrN3IcTEO4KonUfEo4ERZC2DXX4aJxejiyeXD7FgtLOm+F\ndWBBMwC/es0zf+hQHz3B\n=9KUM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-03T21:51:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"h