(#168)\n\nOptionally support lazy loading when constructing a bundle.\n\nWhen constructing a bundle with `--lazy`, implement `getModule` with\n`React.lazy` for all stripes modules except handlers, which define\nstatic methods that are accessed outside the React render lifecycle, and\nwhich are lost when the module is loaded via `lazy(() => import(...))`\n(STRWEB-52).\n\nRefs STRWEB-137","tree":{"sha":"94ccd0ad7d431cac1995f0e504b3c28dff874134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/trees/94ccd0ad7d431cac1995f0e504b3c28dff874134"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/folio-org/stripes-webpack/git/commits/275366dd96ff75d12111ab67c8635c69d64d464e","verification":{"payload":"tree 94ccd0ad7d431cac1995f0e504b3c28dff874134\nparent 98416545c7ec7e08831b5817eb782125994944dd\nauthor Zak Burke <zburke@ebsco.com> 1761584290 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761584290 -0400\n\nSTRWEB-137 optionally support lazy loading (#168)\n\nOptionally support lazy loading when constructing a bundle.\n\nWhen constructing a bundle with `--lazy`, implement `getModule` with\n`React.lazy` for all stripes modules except handlers, which define\nstatic methods that are accessed outside the React render lifecycle, and\nwhich are lost when the module is loaded via `lazy(() => import(...))`\n(STRWEB-52).\n\nRefs STRWEB-137","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo/6SiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdacQAAwyI9qGYx0wuEJgVSudcNhr\nDgz4c2Y9BPjuCVlxTgr4l0BODvie8knpuFDzFR/yUcWxCCvoIAP5URuEQMY4BVZE\n6961SLQtWvrKZxTdfjI4+QBaUH/aRHA2gGOEyhyVyA8om9GZJe607jBz8TW4r1aJ\n36+m2y9l1Fx//Qiw1xLha101VFgyxZRtva+KwfEJMaAo+/9bF95MptEBXy+G0vyO\nP/PwgsK/hYgvq4X0qIBGHqLvlZm5pd6WTxjvpFtQJq2pi1uy49yzKF8FYX6Ir314\nMSzjSj4+GjrtF6k9rx6Wyzl9dX7OYmWuNSFR5Cs2xKoAJAaPhVOhj1HzyLQq1m7j\nYQgVs9V2agoFj34F9Hy8ZcmVWr9eMcM+tQWgFN1AQ8LyaRbp7rjkek2dxmDUUMFN\nn5oBhy3GLJXBB/Xa5A4zW+uinQ3UvBgZIgq3K8nX/jzlUWBw63CGnXZBTNA1xzuz\n6/eJWFOxROxSJZuOcq4edfGMtwXr2tiAeMtnfPKqqDDmiaWL+jxdvpbBC+51wub