-0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1744139121 -0400\n\nSTRWEB-134 prune `stripes.js` and its deps (#166)\n\n`./stripes.js` appears to be a legacy import from stripes-core and\nhasn''t been touched since. I think stripes-core''s tools were completely\noverhauled in their conversion to becoming stripes-cli, and this script\njust got lost along the way.\n\n`commander` is worth considering as a well-maintained alternative to\n`yargs` in stripes-cli, but that''s a whole different project.\n\nRefs STRWEB-134","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJn9XNxCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB6gQAEPer4TDTzqJg6geWInMLovD\nBuVAK/yDksY9C4k5t6NCitWPQq0Mbq3733OdrtQ2pX31Jc8Iq2hLcBPguyQOEFo9\ntnmxFZt9uMhH8dqZpS0frsBDdK/MiI7Dh2Wgukv5xJItuVcmrxLxL5KAHkZE1ntX\n7XyWpGFP9wbDY5g/gEAbKguB1pFY1pFiGVpGS5Hhp6ddQXv6GxQ5YEzdv2tK8Pqp\nkEPsUsN/9iuZXXivg+g4uOZ1lzv9KnGUJcoKz6JmTPlMRX5HtRl2/QDBG4BPz21Y\nJXWf7HB+XScaY2Nh9ufu+dtafsCh2sZHp+xC08nCujvGFMPZb3cwt738LeWA6q6N\nZlCSOGaQpjbR74Wg5hqPqOOiUmITS1lgG1RltRBIhaQA5Yib1qXFgUN2r8FGWW/5\n0HTpJCQOmJfJkuykiGYeINi+rxR/IM7BWz3x66cy4s87J4cp4cTV17lVgu2aD1Me\nHhXG7EOfUk6NlEM61ypTdE9jrETJqmDPcv3WEZlmbfwr2XtkSFQoKzg+wpl/cS3o\nfeDIertc3gdiynOkSc9dXpXlvbTecplcOTc256QMXys9cK3sct3SoisURakuexQH\nLiiu80YiRArT/yATUtxmUAbTZweuSfBFKdraqhq4iPxl0Eaqo8jC/qVtu+xwEnd/\nsF3pZtvRk/2Y6m5AyD7K\n=4OXr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-04-08T19:05:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"h