ME"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:22:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[IGNORE] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler errors (#4481)\n\n* [IGNORE] Upgrade Oxfmt and Oxlint with React diagnostics\n\n- Enforce React Compiler and React Doctor rules as errors\n- Fix resulting React hook and datasource cache invalidation issues\n- Add ExploreView coverage and update plugin templates\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\n\n* Fable review\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\n\n* [IGNORE] Enforce no explicit any in UI and plugin templates\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\n\n* Bump version\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Address review nits on ExploreView tests and SecretEditorForm\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume <gladorme@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fcb7d6fea9ea8011295a7886baebf629fd3f56fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/fcb7d6fea9ea8011295a7886baebf629fd3f56fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/04dbe5f8badc312c19a4f8dc1c6f3e2f9d140063","verification":{"payload":"tree fcb7d6fea9ea8011295a7886baebf629fd3f56fa\nparent 63050a2afd55823b16843c89abf3d2c435656cfd\nauthor Guillaume LADORME <Gladorme@users.noreply.github.com> 1791458550 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791458550 +0000\n\n[IGNORE] Upgrade Oxlint and fix React Compiler errors (#4481)\n\n* [IGNORE] Upgrade Oxfmt and Oxlint with React diagnostics\n\n- Enforce React Compiler and React Doctor rules as errors\n- Fix resulting React hook and datasource cache invali