 to the datasource\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n* Proxy: ignore the Authorization header set in the datasource config whatever its case\n\nDocument the exceptions to the caller credentials removal (delegated authorization, disabled authentication, header policies).\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"45313a3d2b45531870d29812b3e464667e36eede","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/45313a3d2b45531870d29812b3e464667e36eede"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/835dc3550cb83ac011b1391e829e8a7c81754f36","verification":{"payload":"tree 45313a3d2b45531870d29812b3e464667e36eede\nparent 7a69b8008682249a52621779955fcbda979f30bf\nauthor Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com> 1791209978 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791209978 +0200\n\n[BUGFIX] Proxy: do not forward the caller credentials to the datasource (#4553)\n\n* [BUGFIX] Proxy: do not forward the caller credentials to the datasource\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n* Proxy: ignore the Authorization header set in the datasource config whatever its case\n\nDocument the exceptions to the caller credentials removal (delegated authorization, disabled authentication, header policies).\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw7H6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFNsQAK1PqGnTC9knRX3gqUKSLHKm\nlcgz+4xt93R1gk4rWnxQfsPU+aoMOXeDOCanQskXSxTKmva8/+mzi2huu6eo/M9C\nFwRQN7dvEWLtE+jYi8+7AsFTfcSNXrHNtRE9OdDPdygMxUCjrJoGm+bdNHAmKxtY\nIHlmWqvln0GxG2WN7cA8IY31C48ObFnUfGyGQ7hZ6lLnH6dxrVRcDW3Q1FN1hLSr\n90/1+3NWa4JKhwNDUf1gNarpzyol8h4iDcA6EsDAdSwfVtJ0kJKVlxPr+9Yp5ivu\nzrBxmiOmq1m+525yymAbyzjqdVKRiyC2wJwhBhieWQ3Lhx7WGarid8nGTmTKqRY8\njdC/amvpZ