i.github.com/users/CypherNova1337/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CypherNova1337/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CypherNova1337","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/9ab17cd5b1bf760c5d81a3560b977e9cd5a06930/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:10:17Z","email":"131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com","name":"CypherNova1337"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T13:10:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"SQL proxy: reject INTO OUTFILE/DUMPFILE, document PostgreSQL file-reading functions (#4535)\n\nA read-only transaction prevents changes to the tables, but MySQL and\nMariaDB both permit SELECT ... INTO OUTFILE / INTO DUMPFILE inside a\nread-only transaction: with the FILE privilege of the datasource''s\ndatabase user, such a query writes a file on the database host. Reject\nthe two patterns in sanitizeAndValidateQuery (text-based check; a string\nliteral containing the exact pattern is rejected too, accepted\ntrade-off).\n\nAlso document the PostgreSQL file-reading functions (pg_read_file,\npg_ls_dir, pg_read_binary_file) in the safety-net list of the SQL proxy\ndocumentation, trim form feed / vertical tab before the first keyword\n(whitespace in PostgreSQL), and include the underlying error in the\nread-only transaction failure response.\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"03aa35d6c66584ac4ab5e5328acc1f449ed49240","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/03aa35d6c66584ac4ab5e5328acc1f449ed49240"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/9ab17cd5b1bf760c5d81a3560b977e9cd5a06930","verification":{"payload":"tree 03aa35d6c66584ac4ab5e5328acc1f449ed49240\nparent faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d\nauthor CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com> 1790860217 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790860217 +0000\n\nSQL proxy: reject INTO OUTFILE/DUMPFILE, document PostgreSQL file-reading functions (#4535)\n\nA read-only transaction prevents changes to the tables, but MySQL and\nMariaDB both permit SELECT ... INTO OUTFILE / INTO DUMPFILE inside a\nread-only transaction: with the FILE privilege of the datasource''s\ndatabase user, such a query writes a file on the database host. Reject\nthe two patterns in sanitizeAndValidateQuery (text-based check; a string\nliteral containing the exact pattern is rejected too, accepted\ntrade-off).\n\nAlso document the PostgreSQL file-reading functions (pg_read_file,\npg_ls_dir, pg_read_binary_file) in the safety-net list of the SQL proxy\ndocumentation, trim form feed / vertical tab before the first keyword\n(whitespace in PostgreSQL), and include the underlying error in the\nread-only transaction failure response.\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvlvJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvogQAEXuiAVkoacbFw/rjH3IYFwj\nJUu8g7JdT4a0F+EbN5l/9lO141hy0nzjIWjWdOtKR0n9SjbJHbGFFruAOv1uegru\ni8g3p98B/rckHIF/qv/+XZQYqn9aqMECdEnBRR4UVL9/4ha+MkhtONRPL+Dp9zXD\nrw8XGUwyXr958i/tEVbsxlxWTxjCKFoiqGcSp0y5hc1oF+wKQ4z8O9TL+v8zmfw8\nrLnqd2+w9iSP62HuhV2vWDNSS+MjVxLS9zcyX+jHeEbBBt7tyP+JrU2k7WMiJXMi\na03xq1ujZzQiTDxJLyRCtSTsD/F3MJdNjPCatUhRoBBk+LtkkZ+hK/Phs/K/YvA8\ngdZzXZ7LSuGxNTDP7uLn5bgjS+zZZhO96DzfUpK++3CbF3oWxuAjV5DemYKkLS2r\ncRPjbvkeEpTTPpUE6WMmZrty0H1Dc7SQbHAgoQDk5o8PHkSKLM2lOGC5cby2ccIl\nZUm9lRe3hSmptDMbptdkKvvOeXifHZnh2xGXw2hM4MFihtHy+GuCZ81tEJdQvePj\n+DRL6kUE8EW6HAgSGEUeDHzOIcKmOXonxqz+z6B6jTumPgGfnvJ/mJkSda252kpT\nGE8wCf0IW2uoPJTCbZ0etRRXAT9xch/m92s+OjOfLwzbu/3VgdO4bo7UCJqDLwLC\n2GTvAwZzNAIU05WiI7v8\n=S8rK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T13:10:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/9ab17cd5b1bf760c5d81a3560b977e9cd5a06930","node_id":"C_kwDOE9xoStoAKDlhYjE3Y2Q1YjFiZjc2MGM1ZDgxYTM1NjBiOTc3ZTljZDVhMDY5MzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d","sha":"faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d"}],"sha":"9ab17cd5b1bf760c5d81a3560b977e9cd5a06930","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/9ab17cd5b1bf760c5d81a3560b977e9cd5a06930"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78229815?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Sarthak-Shreshtha01","id":78229815,"login":"Sarthak-Shreshtha01","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MjI5ODE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sarthak-Shreshtha01","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:42:03Z","email":"78229815+Sarthak-Shreshtha01@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sarthak Shreshtha"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T10:42:03Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] include dashboard tags in project view search (#4446)\n\n* [BUGFIX] include dashboard tags in project view search\n\nThe dashboard list search bar within a project view filters by\ndashboard/folder name but silently excludes tags, because TanStack\nTable''s default global-filter eligibility check only accepts\nstring/number column values, and the tags column exposed a string[].\n\nAdds a derived tagsSearchValue field (tags joined into a single\nstring) that the table uses for filtering/sorting, while the tag\nchips still render from the original tags array.\n\nFixes #4440\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] set tagsSearchValue on nested subfolder rows\n\nSubfolder rows built in mapFolderItemsToTableRow were missing the\ntagsSearchValue field added for tag search, leaving it undefined at\nruntime for any folder nested inside another folder. Adds the missing\nfield and a regression test.\n\nAddresses review feedback on #4446\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] add tests for tag search accessor\n\nExtract the Tags column into TAGS_COLUMN and add tests covering\ntagsSearchValue and the column''s accessor, per review feedback on #4446.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"54b11fa56926ad7172f3133692b5b703daa8e8fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/54b11fa56926ad7172f3133692b5b703daa8e8fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d","verification":{"payload":"tree 54b11fa56926ad7172f3133692b5b703daa8e8fc\nparent 040ca66cf79d5316b3d75f0327b4065f9d4e6116\nauthor Sarthak Shreshtha <78229815+Sarthak-Shreshtha01@users.noreply.github.com> 1790851323 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790851323 +0000\n\n[BUGFIX] include dashboard tags in project view search (#4446)\n\n* [BUGFIX] include dashboard tags in project view search\n\nThe dashboard list search bar within a project view filters by\ndashboard/folder name but silently excludes tags, because TanStack\nTable''s default global-filter eligibility check only accepts\nstring/number column values, and the tags column exposed a string[].\n\nAdds a derived tagsSearchValue field (tags joined into a single\nstring) that the table uses for filtering/sorting, while the tag\nchips still render from the original tags array.\n\nFixes #4440\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] set tagsSearchValue on nested subfolder rows\n\nSubfolder rows built in mapFolderItemsToTableRow were missing the\ntagsSearchValue field added for tag search, leaving it undefined at\nruntime for any folder nested inside another folder. Adds the missing\nfield and a regression test.\n\nAddresses review feedback on #4446\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>\n\n* [BUGFIX] add tests for tag search accessor\n\nExtract the Tags column into TAGS_COLUMN and add tests covering\ntagsSearchValue and the column''s accessor, per review feedback on #4446.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sarthak-Shreshtha01 <sarthakshreshtha345@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvjkKCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVVIQAJQgAwe69XT5jtdRgPUWPMx+\naZF6a6CfVkMUxFM4RjnZ8SS7J444jksQG96/uXSSnQyXzXT59SRE2sMoE8z0uHhp\nFAfST9Bw/5YE13usmDgZBiwa/DukRaSi4OPS2uzjEUuNjsTYk7dalDIt/Lsp0T55\nu7F4DBianQE2qD2Lz7j8nTNzq/cEHhP/Cv8vDOXARiKVcB1lJtPij2VeQOGFyIZt\npW011aJNxMKwuicws+P5Rkch0xc8fuY7bzDY3FZYScwZEVEr2nSgsqjC7Q9g56ET\n80pDB1CScMqp8PkjjvyxNZdFuPtAxUcpHfEfmiW0yuFEm3uXOAp+8gVmLipeSR9Y\nItxyerkgxjAXGuG9KDxqNFWlhDvZGiIqPj589H+MXt40qtW8NhBq4KyCW4gW/Ck9\ntEXW9sSGc0UoVYEoEcEkVqKLKd5jizIQ+m7w5yroanFW8A6EgICxbYbMrpuLtaU+\nnQidVinNMwkGL7m28meZVn+0GqhqqapGpDnflkZdBgRE3+Ag1G5tKswjbjRQTZjo\n4omPMXltjybq7F4sUEteeM9pfLhk1LrEsEq9pFrdsn4L+orI8gzj0waok8A+lNKx\n0IItXxmHVcRGfsd6AAPI4dX+0l6uV5HYi/NSCIZ2EOoLotIdcz00Lod63/rfU034\nW/7uwFE+Tm6/rLKh5sMr\n=YpA9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-01T10:42:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d","node_id":"C_kwDOE9xoStoAKGZhZWNhY2FjZThkYTU5ZGVjNTJiMmQyNDhiNTNkMzNmMDIzOTAyN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/040ca66cf79d5316b3d75f0327b4065f9d4e6116","sha":"040ca66cf79d5316b3d75f0327b4065f9d4e6116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/040ca66cf79d5316b3d75f0327b4065f9d4e6116"}],"sha":"faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/faecacace8da59dec52b2d248b53d33f0239027d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4548045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nexucis","id":4548045,"login":"Nexucis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDgwNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/040ca66cf79d5316b3d75f0327b4065f9d4e6116/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:33:45Z","email":"husson.augustin@gmail.com","name":"Augustin Husson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:33:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[ENHANCEMENT] Cache content-hashed fonts and images as immutable static assets (#4533)\n\nThe regexp used to detect content-hashed assets only matched JS and CSS bundles. Fonts and images emitted with a content hash by rspack (e.g. ef6d3f52c547a6e3.woff2) and by the plugins (e.g. inter-latin-600-normal.ce0f5f43.woff2) were served with Cache-Control: no-cache, forcing the browser to revalidate them on every page load.\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca4d399e0c42ca70ea05e5ab98ffcdf8e6c37813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/ca4d399e0c42ca70ea05e5ab98ffcdf8e6c37813"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/040ca66cf79d5316b3d75f0327b4065f9d4e6116","verification":{"payload":"tree ca4d399e0c42ca70ea05e5ab98ffcdf8e6c37813\nparent cbbee7052e4fe6fcf9d05309f6e624c6228c0b3d\nauthor Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com> 1790840025 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790840025 +0000\n\n[ENHANCEMENT] Cache content-hashed fonts and images as immutable static assets (#4533)\n\nThe regexp used to detect content-hashed assets only matched JS and CSS bundles. Fonts and images emitted with a content hash by rspack (e.g. ef6d3f52c547a6e3.woff2) and by the plugins (e.g. inter-latin-600-normal.ce0f5f43.woff2) were served with Cache-Control: no-cache, forcing the browser to revalidate them on every page load.\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvgzmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAdpEQAKO4TJKQkNJcg78JVcziC5Wx\n6HvmYu2tEf/E3H9iTVRJ2fUFIGH+EXurb0KeqMsF5Hztst/QRpT2JD3niC1FPdbE\ncWg7V6ZgKvPSTpsnclNzWR+xvg1O4FQu+7dsTMudJokcI/RwsjGOZspzVRHLHxw4\ncr2r5+3uYEqVoVupNBGjs9oKgFUmO8OnnCDYHt0WlOC2E64KeteShq2VwNsTX7JW\n1uY59zyk/HTKwgawcS+WgQk319jEmLYSAmt37pTc4YQtJmJP7kwLN3IIQJR2OFRu\nDYmxUjRJf5OiAyncuoEoR9X/eo153dzrX3e7nfoLJeoPh6UosWOKTdCresejYBby\nkHy+0oE5VTOx57bZIkReFlHBlFzQdZ0aKhZWnQ4U7fgCNePVv2gXz3B2Rj+vXijx\n0JNVUyFj9YKvM8G2Qieajr