s/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Nexucis","id":4548045,"login":"Nexucis","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDgwNDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nexucis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/6fc0c58510c0543627856ea708c28f11c9e8a765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:13:06Z","email":"husson.augustin@gmail.com","name":"Augustin Husson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:13:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[FEATURE] datasource proxy: bound the HTTP proxy timeout with the server config (#4525)\n\n* [FEATURE] datasource proxy: bound the HTTP proxy timeout with the server config\n\nBump perses/spec to v0.3.0-beta.10, which adds a timeout to the HTTP proxy spec.\nAdd datasource.http_proxy.default_timeout and max_timeout to the server config.\nA datasource can only lower the timeout: it is validated when saved and clamped at runtime.\nAdd the Timeout option to the go-sdk.\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n* proxy timeout: address review\n\n- default_timeout follows max_timeout when only max_timeout is set lower than 30s, instead of failing at startup.\n- Log the clamped timeout of unsaved datasources at debug level to avoid log flooding.\n- Remove an unreachable negative check, document the nil proxy config at call sites, and document the update behavior after lowering max_timeout.\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n* docs: scope the connection timeout security note to HTTP proxy datasources\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2d5311fb649d737176d23c59fde2c346850f1b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/c2d5311fb649d737176d23c59fde2c346850f1b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/6fc0c58510c0543627856ea708c28f11c9e8a765","verification":{"payload":"tree c2d5311fb649d737176d23c59fde2c346850f1b7\nparent 379673eb0e1198cb21536fae72e2d334d7d6a6a1\nauthor Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com> 1790698386 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790698386 +0000\n\n[FEATURE] datasource proxy: bound the HTTP proxy timeout with the server config (#4525)\n\n* [FEATURE] datasource proxy: bound the HTTP proxy timeout with the server config\n\nBump perses/spec to v0.3.0-beta.10, which adds a timeout to the HTTP proxy spec.\nAdd datasource.http_proxy.default_timeout and max_timeout to the server config.\nA datasource can only lower the timeout: it is validated when saved and clamped at runtime.\nAdd the Timeout option to the go-sdk.\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n* proxy timeout: address review\n\n- default_timeout follows max_timeout when only max_timeout is set lower than 30s, instead of failing at startup.\n- Log the clamped timeout of unsaved datasources at debug level to avoid log flooding.\n- Remove an unreachable negative check, document the nil proxy config at call sites, and document the update behavior after lowering max_timeout.\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n* docs: scope the connection timeout security note to HTTP proxy datasources\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Augustin Husson <husson.augustin@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAA