e intro note, fold the\nadvisories pointer into the intro and drop the section.\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"5129529c58caaf102a35612047af7b7b61f6e1bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/5129529c58caaf102a35612047af7b7b61f6e1bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/a78c0386d9c1feebe879def952ebb0a2e9d35010","verification":{"payload":"tree 5129529c58caaf102a35612047af7b7b61f6e1bd\nparent 4bc55dc8d12ef503698a77bdaaa722686e5ab106\nauthor CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com> 1790605994 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790605994 +0000\n\ndocs: add security considerations page (#4512)\n\n* docs: add security considerations page\n\nDocuments the security-relevant deployment choices: the no-auth default,\ndatasource proxy target and secret-attachment behavior, secret encryption\nand file-reference restrictions, and SQL backend notes.\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* docs: link SECURITY.md by URL and merge reporting note into intro\n\nThe website does not inject the security documentation, so the relative\nlink does not resolve there; point at the canonical GitHub URL instead.\nThe separate Reporting section duplicated the intro note, fold the\nadvisories pointer into the intro and drop the section.\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: CypherNova1337 <131998711+CypherNova1337@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqunq6CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhpcQAAuvSbUDf6+1TRuXK8CqPHJc\n7OqeuUkyBxT2GdntfrpKJCQaP+k9jV7cVaxu8mC+euma7ZgMNQKNxZ/6+ujbSorD\n0HesR1/khJrBEkonCgybJnb+SXeXqoz5EfZpAvFR32xlZs4iy54WwAOU9kxQxuuk\n/h4xY3n5pAxzsTFsGFD+R6hjUp