omments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:53:22Z","email":"95852276+ayanarukasar@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ayana Rukasar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:53:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[ENHANCEMENT] Allow opening dashboards and tabs in new tabs (#4252)\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Allow opening dashboards and tabs in new tabs\n\nUse RouterLink for project/admin tab navigation and ephemeral\ndashboard list links so users can open pages in a new browser tab.\n\nAdd MenuLinkTab with proper TypeScript types for MUI Tab + RouterLink.\n\nFixes #1544\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana-Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\n\n* ci: retrigger checks\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana-Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Use default cursor on ephemeral dashboard rows\n\nRow clicks no longer navigate, so keep the pointer cursor only on the name link.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana-Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Ayana Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"71002e4d9a3eac3b027ea46002678665882e3811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/71002e4d9a3eac3b027ea46002678665882e3811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/6f00dfba562a52bc45f6464a911e1d98a9b2e59d","verification":{"payload":"tree 71002e4d9a3eac3b027ea46002678665882e3811\nparent 6a300ca6951d06491a26f23f1f7209aec8d48efa\nauthor Ayana Rukasar <95852276+ayanarukasar@users.noreply.github.com> 1789721602 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789721602 +0000\n\n[ENHANCEMENT] Allow opening dashboards and tabs in new tabs (#4252)\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Allow opening dashboards and tabs in new tabs\n\nUse RouterLink for project/admin tab navigation and ephemeral\ndashboard list links so users can open pages in a new browser tab.\n\nAdd MenuLinkTab with proper TypeScript types for MUI Tab + RouterLink.\n\nFixes #1544\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana-Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\n\n* ci: retrigger checks\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana-Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\n\n* [ENHANCEMENT] Use default cursor on ephemeral dashboard rows\n\nRow clicks no longer navigate, so keep the pointer cursor only on the name link.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Ayana-Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Ayana Rukasar <ayanark1515@gmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrPwMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPMwQAD8MgMPgANGjuBfvXwJ9GH0A\nJuRUeZumZ3nCX7tD6t8AqQoFMHreb9CEB/AkAdb+nJigv4AuoXwLSpFQa5HWGiWz\nKDrTMNIyaV+Wlwzclnocpc8D9PdmtWacaDyD3U9/mX90VWrP3D+pXBvvJlgxVHq7\n7Vuv02wxu34JldN8QDrHfpctYobDSp4n75HzTBdmPNjtHZ8LgPobpmElD9Yr8kV7\nUokLYDPsOXnaV9JxBW8TDBjPfXqy1nVKabxTqNCyvJobhpRKoFJWH68qyFPaUyC2\nae5LKDt2ci/XFko7VDsuB62++0kTzYxzFKgGxuAPaxj7GwxCjglLcGrJePsIP/tb\nGAxMfLcyVpJcb80CTF5Baff5NxyauvpMBLOvXofYTCS2TxUhhd1E5zuwuCohhEq5\nbxGSi8fHWyTYCxSpOyun8Hc2nxV1ZQ5qA4SLKHaaiwDBKIFbbrdVWcqVo3/QOMTN\n1n68FxMgI3u47lOH4+DG7/NTy0zHvn0BuPTNyNlR5GVAIBbT2havyc74o2Cgdb1L\nhiFQzRZFfWM/I/ZHtM1wR8mpzbc9mCqeauSVz+vWMYz876SYNyrrW8Bq2qZ4RQbZ\n6YjicnQbvH0y3ib+NmmsLdHikvNOEUm0H4iwwFcQ021f7quCwF/4pBSkTpInCQsf\nSVsc2b+ds3MPK1GSv8yC\n=J77o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T08:53:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.git