thor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10557236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pujitha24","id":10557236,"login":"pujitha24","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU3MjM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/3cd8c805f4b0122bfafc2034137bb47698b0c99e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:01:18Z","email":"pujitha.rathna@gmail.com","name":"Pujitha Paladugu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T15:01:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] default OIDC/OAuth redirect path to api_prefix, not router basename-relative root (#4437)\n\n* [BUGFIX] default OIDC/OAuth redirect path to api_prefix, not router basename-relative root\n\nWhen Perses is deployed with a non-empty api_prefix (e.g. /perses), a user\nwho visits the landing page directly (no `rd` query param) and signs in via\nan OIDC/OAuth provider is redirected after login to the host root `/`\ninstead of the sub-path, since useRedirectQueryParam()''s fallback was\nhardcoded to ''/''. SignWrapper.tsx feeds that value into the `rd` param sent\nto the backend, which later issues a raw, non-React-Router http.Redirect to\nit, so it needs to be an absolute, api_prefix-inclusive path.\n\nThree other consumers of the same hook (SignInView.tsx, Router.tsx''s\nAlreadyLoggedIn, DelegatedAuthnErrorView.tsx) navigate through React\nRouter, whose router is created with api_prefix as its basename and\nalready prepends it automatically -- so simply changing the hook''s shared\ndefault would fix SignWrapper.tsx but double-prefix those three (e.g.\n/perses/perses).\n\nuseRedirectQueryParam() now takes an optional `{ absolute?: boolean }`\nparameter. Only SignWrapper.tsx opts into `{ absolute: true }`, falling\nback to api_prefix (or ''/'' if unset); the other three call sites are\nunchanged and keep the ''/'' basename-relative fallback.\n\nValidation: `npx turbo run test --filter=@perses-dev/app` passes (152/152,\n14 files), including a new ui/app/src/model/auth/auth-client.test.ts\ncovering all four fallback branches and an updated\nui/app/src/views/auth/SignWrapper.test.tsx asserting the OIDC login\nredirect now carries rd=%2Fperses instead of rd=%2F for an api_prefix of\n/perses. `npx turbo run type-check --filter=@perses-dev/app` and\n`npx turbo run lint --filter=@perses-dev/app` (0 errors; pre-existing\nwarning set on touched files confirmed unchanged via git stash) both pass,\n`npx oxfmt --check` is clean, and `npm run build` succeeds.\n\nReport: https://github.com/perses/perses/issues/4436\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\nAssisted-by: claude-sonnet-5 (via Claude Code)\n\n* [BUGFIX] simplify useRedirectQueryParam to take a plain boolean param\n\nPer review feedback, replace the { absolute?: boolean } options object\nwith a plain absolute?: boolean parameter and update all call sites.\n\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"56a5bfd4afcfa6184e8c6865b44a523ad99a82ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/56a5bfd4afcfa6184e8c6865b44a523ad99a82ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/3cd8c805f4b0122bfafc2034137bb47698b0c99e","verification":{"payload":"tree 56a5bfd4afcfa6184e8c6865b44a523ad99a82ad\nparent c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8\nauthor Pujitha Paladugu <pujitha.rathna@gmail.com> 1789052478 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789052478 +0000\n\n[BUGFIX] default OIDC/OAuth redirect path to api_prefix, not router basename-relative root (#4437)\n\n* [BUGFIX] default OIDC/OAuth redirect path to api_prefix, not router basename-relative root\n\nWhen Perses is deployed with a non-empty api_prefix (e.g. /perses), a user\nwho visits the landing page directly (no `rd` query param) and signs in via\nan OIDC/OAuth provider is redirected after login to the host root `/`\ninstead of the sub-path, since useRedirectQueryParam()''s fallback was\nhardcoded to ''/''. SignWrapper.tsx feeds that value into the `rd` param sent\nto the backend, which later issues a raw, non-React-Router http.Redirect to\nit, so it needs to be an absolute, api_prefix-inclusive path.\n\nThree other consumers of the same hook (SignInView.tsx, Router.tsx''s\nAlreadyLoggedIn, DelegatedAuthnErrorView.tsx) navigate through React\nRouter, whose router is created with api_prefix as its basename and\nalready prepends it automatically -- so simply changing the hook''s shared\ndefault would fix SignWrapper.tsx but double-prefix those three (e.g.\n/perses/perses).\n\nuseRedirectQueryParam() now takes an optional `{ absolute?: boolean }`\nparameter. Only SignWrapper.tsx opts into `{ absolute: true }`, falling\nback to api_prefix (or ''/'' if unset); the other three call sites are\nunchanged and keep the ''/'' basename-relative fallback.\n\nValidation: `npx turbo run test --filter=@perses-dev/app` passes (152/152,\n14 files), including a new ui/app/src/model/auth/auth-client.test.ts\ncovering all four fallback branches and an updated\nui/app/src/views/auth/SignWrapper.test.tsx asserting the OIDC login\nredirect now carries rd=%2Fperses instead of rd=%2F for an api_prefix of\n/perses. `npx turbo run type-check --filter=@perses-dev/app` and\n`npx turbo run lint --filter=@perses-dev/app` (0 errors; pre-existing\nwarning set on touched files confirmed unchanged via git stash) both pass,\n`npx oxfmt --check` is clean, and `npm run build` succeeds.\n\nReport: https://github.com/perses/perses/issues/4436\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\nAssisted-by: claude-sonnet-5 (via Claude Code)\n\n* [BUGFIX] simplify useRedirectQueryParam to take a plain boolean param\n\nPer review feedback, replace the { absolute?: boolean } options object\nwith a plain absolute?: boolean parameter and update all call sites.\n\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqosZOCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADnsQAFXOJJpnNynCYCJPhoY4/I60\nfTORO4ULmWcygKWm5ifi/eCUH7hn4+6sFVUvRcvD+ubn3MOIiDIcSA751P56rPkF\nrdcDa+vWjK3JHynRSOeQNv0hLOyHzb5tJmdOvPO+CRQYOzbngr6u7XKwoX8VOsXe\nbZUCcvfHZCkwlLn6W78fCvRvccU3PWlR59Mltmn8wZuOIt3ViTHh05kpp3FDcJ4A\n6d/pWffjc/LpneqMlV7C0XrBtGrWyp5lxiXPBg2DD3dAD0lWPT3Ay6h20Vr2jw8q\n1gykrSQhr7ia94a01PWCIJpJJ9c8TfOXLoHwzZjEVzyFqj/KwTzfRCZxEanaQmG6\nbu1QNFOXWJmb5APfMMV/4IJhNOCIPjf0OYuYw1HYhAqF8mTlRNdrTmChbBnd1SjH\nW+iZE8fVQYuEsY4O3DMbc8qWZqvkvsBVQ/wqxWLzAtDDbSBdHxZ86FgAbw+R1OQV\nPfIbtYwZOiz+8g24zazsednvYnn7eughQXopIIxz+P7Q06Be56dd4vz6diTgxSwT\nHMOXxW66+8BBpN6CtjOVBdIyfOZxzOYDIKQL8yX3doQgx+6H8jpDMOsG7brDj7pQ\nXF55eyFZW8Gfb9BDf1LSibIXYVJ/M7k9mLkV17O5elu6+Jnm6t0KmGTKs3H4Ugv6\nuFxUi/bwyhw85amVCHbz\n=NgwE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T15:01:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/3cd8c805f4b0122bfafc2034137bb47698b0c99e","node_id":"C_kwDOE9xoStoAKDNjZDhjODA1ZjRiMDEyMmJmYWZjMjAzNDEzN2JiNDc2OThiMGM5OWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8","sha":"c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8"}],"sha":"3cd8c805f4b0122bfafc2034137bb47698b0c99e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/3cd8c805f4b0122bfafc2034137bb47698b0c99e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35531877?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/7487","id":35531877,"login":"7487","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NTMxODc3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/7487","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:28:52Z","email":"1042653432@qq.com","name":"BingEdward"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:28:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[DOC] Document the Annotation plugin kind (#4427)\n\nAnnotation became a first-class plugin kind (`plugin.KindAnnotation`) with\nthe annotation support released in #4040, and `percli plugin generate`\nalready accepts it, but none of the docs mention it.\n\nAdd it to the plugin kinds listed in the Plugin concept page and in the\nplugin creation guide, along with the layout of an annotation plugin\n(`schemas/annotations/<plugin-name>` and `src/annotations/<plugin-name>`,\nmatching the generator templates).\n\nSigned-off-by: 7487 <1042653432@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37e517dc024735a28fa096f583bf64d27a8ee8b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/37e517dc024735a28fa096f583bf64d27a8ee8b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 37e517dc024735a28fa096f583bf64d27a8ee8b7\nparent 62207f6ee9f4ab61d92eaa4e7db6a311e8c1f9af\nauthor BingEdward <1042653432@qq.com> 1789028932 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789028932 +0000\n\n[DOC] Document the Annotation plugin kind (#4427)\n\nAnnotation became a first-class plugin kind (`plugin.KindAnnotation`) with\nthe annotation support released in #4040, and `percli plugin generate`\nalready accepts it, but none of the docs mention it.\n\nAdd it to the plugin kinds listed in the Plugin concept page and in the\nplugin creation guide, along with the layout of an annotation plugin\n(`schemas/annotations/<plugin-name>` and `src/annotations/<plugin-name>`,\nmatching the generator templates).\n\nSigned-off-by: 7487 <1042653432@qq.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqompUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi6kQAAqGDAZB1WjgIBkmDFbFbRtU\n2wwewdYLHSrFZi6m2pxu4qSR1UooRUrkzakSgsXKuyJNLe11ouTRO7Y3GN7FIAI0\n+3ZdmGPKaQDgLwyNz/hyiqtlRmtT1yWorcB8rE1JaoJr5m8XQuca+xxIE15jMLCH\nBsHUUkJfJSDxyPlgWbCyItc3zj6s4QHS+maiMqclEfIrmM0zdIEL3gG5qfAlmppK\nL6ZoyIF4UKdaZkMY004vj/8Q1EvTU5D7C2qWseXCZ+dYMDqcorfpFRYybOfVp6Qk\n9PpU3PDUdILSQs2ckCTLIPuT4yv5f4BqXPuGpR+Z0Ey/v0eSoVVdDoxRvZoMqmM5\no1bYUOVvEpIhMiKkST6cYf9wE391E78mMWosgLsz2ghvszeZTzGus4QreCMztWeI\nOLsY43UHpBUz5LDFBA2+jaZkl+uDsZheK5juIjXJsK6+5dvHgWGMXTDFvn4Ct7ca\nhMIrscB/8H1KPoVATEHeuDlaTkAGgYtAbCbAKOWn6bE1FaxGG30qkrvEK2Hl4QJx\nwCMy9WxHgHcMnR6tpjG0Cw9u9+tiiWgXYAomRq5A4C90yq1aIUA6nJpge2Q+TWn6\nTXc8dhlBrGcjQTS0k3/YxoGYRQZWv3tOXMCZi/jowV0e0GhVph7rs8Szflnc5gEf\ndDV9pvDH3xtbYZ5XNEE+\n=3hI2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T08:29:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8","node_id":"C_kwDOE9xoStoAKGM1MWY1MzY1OWMyMTkwYmQyMmJhOGFmM2ZhZGYwNDQyNjc3ZGJkYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perses/perses/commit/62207f6ee9f4ab61d92eaa4e7db6a311e8c1f9af","sha":"62207f6ee9f4ab61d92eaa4e7db6a311e8c1f9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/62207f6ee9f4ab61d92eaa4e7db6a311e8c1f9af"}],"sha":"c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/c51f53659c2190bd22ba8af3fadf0442677dbdb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10557236?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pujitha24","id":10557236,"login":"pujitha24","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTU3MjM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pujitha24","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/62207f6ee9f4ab61d92eaa4e7db6a311e8c1f9af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:20:43Z","email":"pujitha.rathna@gmail.com","name":"Pujitha Paladugu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T08:20:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[BUGFIX] prefix OIDC/OAuth login redirect with api_prefix (#4433)\n\nMotivation:\nWhen Perses is deployed behind a sub-path (a non-empty api_prefix,\ne.g. /perses), clicking \"Sign in with OIDC/OAuth provider\" redirected\nthe browser to a URL missing the api_prefix. If an Ingress or reverse\nproxy only forwards the sub-path to Perses, this request never reaches\nthe backend and results in a 404, so users deployed behind a sub-path\ncannot log in via OIDC/OAuth at all.\n\nApproach:\nui/app/src/views/auth/SignWrapper.tsx hardcoded the login redirect as\n`/api/auth/providers/${provider.path}/login?...`, while other\nauth-related code in the same app (e.g. the logout link in\nAccountMenu.tsx) correctly prepends PERSES_APP_CONFIG.api_prefix. This\nchange applies the same convention to the login redirect, prepending\nPERSES_APP_CONFIG.api_prefix so the generated URL matches the app''s\nactual base path. With the default api_prefix of '''' (no sub-path\ndeployment), the generated URL is unchanged.\n\nValidation:\nAdded ui/app/src/views/auth/SignWrapper.test.tsx, which renders\nSignWrapper with a mocked api_prefix of \"/perses\", clicks a rendered\nOIDC sign-in button, and asserts the resulting window.location.href.\nConfirmed this test fails against the pre-fix code (asserting the\nold, unprefixed URL) and passes with the fix.\n\nRan from ui/, targeting the affected package:\n- npx turbo run type-check --filter=@perses-dev/app -> passed\n- npx turbo run lint --filter=@perses-dev/app -> 0 errors (pre-existing\n  unrelated warnings only)\n- npx turbo run test --filter=@perses-dev/app -> 148 passed (148),\n  including the new SignWrapper test\n- npm run format:check -> passed\n\nThese are the same checks the repo''s own react.yml PR workflow runs\n(lint, format:check, type-check, test) for the affected UI package.\n\nReport: https://github.com/perses/perses/issues/4431\n\nAssisted-by: claude-sonnet-5 (via Claude Code)\n\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"89182fc8ab0e3c8cc9edb5827b342b978a8a7226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/89182fc8ab0e3c8cc9edb5827b342b978a8a7226"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/commits/62207f6ee9f4ab61d92eaa4e7db6a311e8c1f9af","verification":{"payload":"tree 89182fc8ab0e3c8cc9edb5827b342b978a8a7226\nparent 4dde37c8fca1f98681533bf2a39fdaaec6905f46\nauthor Pujitha Paladugu <pujitha.rathna@gmail.com> 1789028443 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789028443 +0000\n\n[BUGFIX] prefix OIDC/OAuth login redirect with api_prefix (#4433)\n\nMotivation:\nWhen Perses is deployed behind a sub-path (a non-empty api_prefix,\ne.g. /perses), clicking \"Sign in with OIDC/OAuth provider\" redirected\nthe browser to a URL missing the api_prefix. If an Ingress or reverse\nproxy only forwards the sub-path to Perses, this request never reaches\nthe backend and results in a 404, so users deployed behind a sub-path\ncannot log in via OIDC/OAuth at all.\n\nApproach:\nui/app/src/views/auth/SignWrapper.tsx hardcoded the login redirect as\n`/api/auth/providers/${provider.path}/login?...`, while other\nauth-related code in the same app (e.g. the logout link in\nAccountMenu.tsx) correctly prepends PERSES_APP_CONFIG.api_prefix. This\nchange applies the same convention to the login redirect, prepending\nPERSES_APP_CONFIG.api_prefix so the generated URL matches the app''s\nactual base path. With the default api_prefix of '''' (no sub-path\ndeployment), the generated URL is unchanged.\n\nValidation:\nAdded ui/app/src/views/auth/SignWrapper.test.tsx, which renders\nSignWrapper with a mocked api_prefix of \"/perses\", clicks a rendered\nOIDC sign-in button, and asserts the resulting window.location.href.\nConfirmed this test fails against the pre-fix code (asserting the\nold, unprefixed URL) and passes with the fix.\n\nRan from ui/, targeting the affected package:\n- npx turbo run type-check --filter=@perses-dev/app -> passed\n- npx turbo run lint --filter=@perses-dev/app -> 0 errors (pre-existing\n  unrelated warnings only)\n- npx turbo run test --filter=@perses-dev/app -> 148 passed (148),\n  including the new SignWrapper test\n- npm run format:check -> passed\n\nThese are the same checks the repo''s own react.yml PR workflow runs\n(lint, format:check, type-check, test) for the affected UI package.\n\nReport: https://github.com/perses/perses/issues/4431\n\nAssisted-by: claude-sonnet-5 (via Claude Code)\n\nSigned-off-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Pujitha Paladugu <10557236+pujitha24@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqomhrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA4YYQAFReQZs/KxIoji2ZI8dHUBod\nhttRIdkArIS2rFhDGScEg+IMa5IB0m/5CRxeOQFHcs0bnPZBYaY3nNVd6XaBEOog\nVtqQNkj9JRM+ow5f23Yg3A7Pu0xcL/f5o+dBw5mtgQLmib41nmMDwh3XFN50oHjG\n0fIsqZtV+bEIcjsQ8mhBDxSZ+XolhAZp47FKwWKT54eaxe0gcXnZvfQvXbhFOAVQ\nUmf578h/GHBC/Xh7sOc23VRxirNfCsExtkPbbH4OghrIP2WjqNxEdYlWIMRu0BPV\nwBVTVpSQuQbV9y5Xu69fFd/69qQM0GNq8UPHxwKoqCBMxAjNuaiyxkF4W+eOYRuv\nEV9VaJKv5ZYTC6MUHx+VRKKrDqNwf6NOpFhLqR6gnvXlclKdw9BW7oPma26PZalk\n3qXKE0v8NnPnjKCSCWYSiVLlrQXxxCaUrMTkwzStSaCSx90T28lFTK5Lk7KDFtKx\n0F3U7zWHXaI0r1RZZ9xM3S4Wg2RyodJAPRnWP9BukFm1d/62yvzeGIQ27aTB2F0N\nFdF1ceim+pr/ZRbuSXzPqbhyoEX/gMUn3KqwmYmE9RhGB9H2CgaFcgLYY7L64lJl\nCVQfJygzv+ZcGlLaGQ7O/X6DXXkUbhl0P5urlrggI0mSFW13/EuvevDLzlxNwYr5\nmpOoJOHvs0wLmN3paR/7\n=Uh5V\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-10T08:21:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","foll