i.github.com/users/robertpaschedag/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpaschedag/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpaschedag/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpaschedag/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpaschedag","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/commits/4dde37c8fca1f98681533bf2a39fdaaec6905f46/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:05:52Z","email":"153717553+robertpaschedag@users.noreply.github.com","name":"robertpaschedag"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T10:05:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[FEATURE] support pre-computed bcrypt password hash for user provisioning (#4423)\n\n* [FEATURE] support pre-computed bcrypt password hash for user provisioning\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Paschedag <robert.paschedag@sap.com>\n\n* refactor(user): address PR review feedback on resolvePassword\n\n- Replace switch with if/else for idiomatic Go style\n- Accept NativeProvider struct instead of individual string params\n- Use apiInterface.HandleBadRequestError() instead of fmt.Errorf wrapping\n- Rewrite tests as table-driven single test function\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Paschedag <robert.paschedag@sap.com>\n\n* fix: return nil instead of error when no native password is set\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Paschedag <robert.paschedag@sap.com>\n\n* fix: suppress gosec G101 false positive in test\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Paschedag <robert.paschedag@sap.com>\n\n* test: remove obsolete empty-password test case\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Paschedag <robert.paschedag@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Robert Paschedag <robert.paschedag@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbbb258304d365a61b4c087df9af590c87ec8c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perses/perses/git/trees/cbbb258304d365a61b4c087df9af590c87ec8c62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/r