ji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/77da82f44d46ac684a0e5e619194d28b4091363e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:11:11Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:11:11Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"feat(element-plus): select value 支持 #N 按序号选中第 N 个可见选项\n\n选项多、label 难抄时，value 填 #1/#2/...（1 起）直接点面板中第 N 个\n\"可见\"选项，v-show 过滤掉的项不计数。\n\n- findOption 加序号回退：data-value/label 精确匹配都失败后才按 #N 取序，\n  所以选项文本恰好是 \"#2\" 时仍按文本命中\n- fillElSelect：#N 不走 filterable 输入路径，不把 \"#2\" 当关键词输进过滤框\n- README 补用法；新增 6 个测试（越界 / #0 / label 撞车 / 隐藏项不计数 /\n  filterable 旁路）\n- 版本 3.2.0\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc3e508ecd2e76b7b7a9fdfcfd9edd6524c53527","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/dc3e508ecd2e76b7b7a9fdfcfd9edd6524c53527"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/77da82f44d46ac684a0e5e619194d28b4091363e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","