/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/beea611f7986eefe952a167533c28d0d8baeea5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:57:45Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T07:57:45Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(element-plus): EU2 选中态 class 是 selected，修复填充后误报 v-model 未更新\n\n- 87c0853 加的点击后校验只认 EP 的 is-selected / aria-selected，Element UI 2\n  (Vue2) 的 option 选中 class 是 selected 且无 aria-selected → 每次 EU2 填充\n  都误报\"v-model 可能没有更新\"；一并接受 selected\n- 新增忠实复刻 EU2.15 真实 DOM/事件链路的回归测试：.el-input readonly 触发、\n  dropdown 持久挂 body 靠自身 v-show 切 display、@click.stop option 选中\n- 版本 3.1.3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6aa99c5d750dcad00504c9659561187a43e49ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/f6aa99c5d750dcad00504c9659561187a43e49ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/beea611f7986eefe952a167533c28d0d8baeea5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_a