ldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/0c7b6339ba2546b30416dd7651f95640a270168f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:54:10Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:54:10Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"refactor: 修 #4-#9 检视项 + bonus 修复 tab 跨 re-render\n\n- element-plus.js (findOption): label 匹配前先折叠空白 + 替换 NBSP，\n  对含嵌套 span/i 的选项宽容（旧实现严格要求 textContent === value）\n- config-ui.js:\n  - 新增 on() helper + registeredListeners 数组，closeUI 时统一解绑\n    shadow / document 上的所有 listener，避免 listener 在已分离的 shadow\n    root 上累计直到 GC\n  - bindTabs 改为在 root 上委托 click：旧实现逐按钮绑定，render()\n    重置 innerHTML 后新按钮无监听 → tab 切换在 add-page 等动作后失效\n  - escapeAttr 去壳，直接 const escapeAttr = escapeHtml\n  - formatShortcutLabel 改用 navigator.userAgentData?.platform，回退\n    到 UA 字符串（navigator.platform 已废弃）\n  - selector-modal 增 Tab 焦点陷阱（用 e.target 比对首尾 focusable），\n    并把 Tab 监听挂到 shadow root（happy-dom 不模拟 shadow→document\n    composed path），Esc/Cmd+Enter 仍挂 document 以兜底外层快捷键\n\n- test 新增 6 个回归测试：NBSP 匹配、tab 跨 re-render、Tab 陷阱 ×3\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d5b36b2384595431ebcbb8760eab9cbc8e717c1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/5d5b36b2384595431ebcbb8760eab9cbc8e717c1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/0c7b6339ba2546b30416dd7651f95640a270168f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"v