ttps://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/cf265e79c2007f313783b68cfc67a112547109ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:43:36Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:43:36Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix: 删除死代码 + 修复 executeFill 清标记条件 + close helper 派到 document\n\n- core.js: 删除空实现且无任何调用的 _resetForTest；executeFill 的清标记\n  改为无条件（之前只在 !AUTO_FILL_ON_LOAD 时清，开启 auto-fill 后手动按快捷键\n  会因 isFilled 拦截而什么都不填）\n- fillers/element-plus.js: closeOpenSelectDropdowns / closeOpenCascaderPanels\n  从 body.dispatchEvent 改为 document.dispatchEvent。Element Plus 的\n  clickoutside 指令监听在 document 而非 body，body 上的 dispatchEvent\n  在真实浏览器里不会被 EP 的监听器看到 —— 之前能\"work\"是 happy-dom 不严格\n  的副作用\n- 测试：close helper 测试断言改为 document listener + 加上\"不应派到 body\"的\n  负向断言；smart mock EP clickoutside 行为改为在 document 上监听，与真实\n  行为一致；core 测试新增 AUTO_FILL_ON_LOAD=true 时手动 executeFill\n  能重新填充的回归用例\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0f05c04b8a970015bb47044e03ddfae8837b741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/c0f05c04b8a970015bb47044e03ddfae8837b741"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/cf265e79c2007f313783b68cfc67a112547109ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":fa