_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/b39628d2d2bf9e956794d479e16cab8c58059652/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:18:06Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:18:06Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(fillers): el-select / cascader 失败路径主动关闭残留面板\n\n旧实现：找不到选项 / 找不到菜单 / 面板超时只 dispatch blur 就 return false，\n.el-select-dropdown / .el-cascader-panel 仍 visible 在 body 上。下一个 fill 触发\n时 getVisibleDropdown 按 DOM 顺序返回第一个可见面板（可能是前一个的），后续\nfindOption 在错的面板里找 value → 静默失败 / 填错地方。\n\n新增 closeOpenSelectDropdowns / closeOpenCascaderPanels 工具：扫可见面板 →\n在 document.body 上派 mousedown + click 触发 Element Plus clickoutside 关闭。\n\nfillElSelect / fillElCascader：\n- 入口加 close + wait(10)（清理上次失败遗留）\n- 所有 return false 之前加 close（不留残留）\n\n- element-plus.test.js: +11 (close 单元测试 + 智能 mock 验证遗留场景)\n- README: 并行组章节加 ⚠️ 多 select 同组风险\n\n测试 179/179 通过\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0e10c665130ce1e49a5672ad41ac914f8fcc93e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/d0e10c665130ce1e49a5672ad41ac914f8fcc93e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/b39628d2d2bf9e956794d479e16cab8c58059652","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/u