com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/5a2556a23671be8e4640fa89ad1602e0ff64f943/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:58:08Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:58:08Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"feat(core): 字段支持 parallelGroup 同名字段并发填充\n\n默认行为仍是按数组顺序串行，保护 select 级联 / 输入框联动依赖。\n字段可选 parallelGroup: string —— 同名连续项作为一个原子单元，组内\nPromise.all 并行；同名被隔开时按位置拆为多次独立执行。\n\n- core: 新增 buildSchedule / runSchedule，executeFill 和 autoFillIfEnabled 复用\n- config-storage: normalizeField 接受并保留 parallelGroup（trim 后非空字符串）\n- config-ui: fields-table 加\"并行组\"列，input handler 把空值从字段中删除\n- 测试 +55（core 8 / storage 4 / ui 5），全套 168 通过\n- README 同步文档化新功能\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ff96c562bdecad675f65d489b379e564bbb5623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/5ff96c562bdecad675f65d489b379e564bbb5623"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/5a2556a23671be8e4640fa89ad1602e0ff64f943","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluo