ail":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(core): setupProfileSwitchShortcut 重复调用时清理旧 handler\n\n复现：保存配置后脚本通过 autofill:config-updated 再次调用\nsetupProfileSwitchShortcut，但旧版没移除上一个 keydown listener，\n导致每次按键触发两次 cycleProfile，互相抵消（default → demo → default）。\n\n修复：用模块级变量持有 handler，重复注册前先 removeEventListener；\n同 setupShortcut 的写法。\n\n新增回归测试：连续 setup 3 次，按一次键，active profile 应只切一次。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9987209f2923e3a19e9167b15dfb8b557d4aca28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/9987209f2923e3a19e9167b15dfb8b557d4aca28"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/4f5614e8ed696fbe32b51ad14eb223eb27143ce0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/4f5614e8ed696fbe32b51ad14eb223eb27143ce0","node_id":"C_kwDOE-3HJNoAKDRmNTYxNGU4ZWQ2OTZmYmUzMmI1MWFkMTRlYjIyM2ViMjcxNDNjZTA","paren