//api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/4331e8facf31907166617251d2e351cbac3dc4dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T02:44:09Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T02:44:09Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(index): 配置页快捷键改为 Meta+Ctrl+Shift+K\n\n原 Ctrl+Alt+C 与浏览器/IDE 冲突较多。改为 Cmd+Ctrl+Shift+K：\n- Mac: Cmd+Ctrl+Shift+K（冷门，不与系统/Chrome 冲突）\n- Win: Win+Ctrl+Shift+K（冷门）\n- 不使用 Alt，规避 Mac 上 Option 与字母组合易触发特殊字符的问题\n\n同步更新浮动按钮的 title 提示。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95f0b2afa60f8377b563c981a8d8fe69d7d635ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/95f0b2afa60f8377b563c981a8d8fe69d7d635ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/4331e8facf31907166617251d2e351cbac3dc4dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/4331e8facf31907166617251d2e351cbac3dc4dc","node_id":"C_kwDOE-3HJNoAKDQzMzFlOGZhY2YzMTkwNzE2NjYxNzI1MWQyZTM1MWNiYWMzZGM0ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/8411fb5aca69eb453a8b25f14824a4b80b20257f","sha":"8411fb5aca69eb453a8b25f14824a4b80b20257f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/8411fb5aca69eb453a8b25f14824a4b80b20257f"}],"sha":"4331e8facf31907166617251d2e351cbac3dc4dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/4331e8facf31907166617251d2e351cbac3dc4dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/8411fb5aca69eb453a8b25f14824a4b80b20257f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T01:43:03Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T01:43:03Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"feat(core): page config 支持多 profile + 切换快捷键\n\n用户场景：同一页面同一表单有时需要填两套不同内容。\n- schema: page config 增加 profiles: { [name]: { fields } }；旧 fields 写法自动归一为 profiles.default\n- active profile: 按 page name 持久化到 localStorage（form_autofill_active_profiles）\n- 切换快捷键 SHORTCUT_PROFILE_SWITCH（默认 Shift+Meta+P）循环到下一个 profile\n- 切换后清掉新 profile 字段的填充标记，下次填充立即生效\n- UI: page 详情面板加 profile tabs、激活态徽章、新建/删除（至少一个）、测试填充用当前选中的 profile\n- executeFill 接受 profileOverride 参数（UI 测试填充用，不动持久化）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e25d1c365154cc41812028e2a33f81718bcf78d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/e25d1c365154cc41812028e2a33f81718bcf78d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/8411fb5aca69eb453a8b25f14824a4b80b20257f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wor