utlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"feat(element-plus): el-checkbox/radio-group 未匹配时打印候选列表\n\n加 logGroupCandidates 辅助函数，当 group 内 input.value 全部不匹配配置值时，\nconsole.warn 输出所有候选的 value 和 label，方便排查 value 配错问题。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe33670ba9ca149f06a23e73d406d6879eb6891c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/fe33670ba9ca149f06a23e73d406d6879eb6891c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/76b557f48f24eae5b0424982bb86356701693cc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/76b557f48f24eae5b0424982bb86356701693cc7","node_id":"C_kwDOE-3HJNoAKDc2YjU1N2Y0OGYyNGVhZTViMDQyNDk4MmJiODYzNTY3MDE2OTNjYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d","sha":"3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d"}],"sha":"76b557f48f24eae5b0424982bb86356701693cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/76b557f48f24eae5b0424982bb86356701693cc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T12:07:17Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T12:07:17Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(element-plus): el-radio / el-radio-group 加 focus + 等 nextTick\n\n读了 Element Plus 2.x radio.vue 源码，发现关键差异：\n1. input 上用了 v-model=\"modelValue\" + :checked + @change + @click.stop\n2. handleChange 用 nextTick(() => emit(CHANGE_EVENT, modelValue.value))\n3. @focus / @blur 跟踪 isFocused 状态，部分校验会读这个值\n\n之前的 click() + 兜底 change 在某些环境下：\n- 不触发 @focus → 校验可能误判\n- 没等 nextTick → 上层 RadioGroup 的 @change 还没转发\n\n新行为：\n1. input.focus() 触发 @focus（Element Plus 跟踪 focus 状态）\n2. input.click() 浏览器切 checked + dispatch change\n3. 兜底手动 dispatch change\n4. await wait(0) 等 element-plus handleChange 的 nextTick emit 完成\n\nfillElRadio / fillElRadioGroup 都改了。之前的测试通过；新增场景测试不变。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1eed57b0cbff67c59b4e081bc5d0750bf164ddf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/1eed57b0cbff67c59b4e081bc5d0750bf164ddf1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d","node_id":"C_kwDOE-3HJNoAKDNjMTMxNWU0Nzg5ODc5OGY1YzQ0M2JmNGY0MjZlYTU1MDFhNWM1N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/34a6defb19b32efcab38c87880cd2f29c7be20cf","sha":"34a6defb19b32efcab38c87880cd2f29c7be20cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/34a6defb19b32efcab38c87880cd2f29c7be20cf"}],"sha":"3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/3c1315e47898798f5c443bf4f426ea5501a5c57d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/34a6defb19b32efcab38c87880cd2f29c7be20cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:04:32Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:04:32Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(element-plus): 支持 daterange，header 改名 Element UI / Plus\n\ndaterange / datetimerange / monthrange 支持：\n- elDatePickerInput selector 加 .el-range-input（EU 和 EP 2.6+ 通用 class 名）\n- fillElDatePicker 检测容器内 2 个 .el-range-input：value 数组时分填开始/结束，\n  单值时默认填开始日期\n\nheader：\n- @name: 通用表单自动填充（多页面+快捷键版 · Element Plus）\n    → 通用表单自动填充（多页面+快捷键版 · Element UI / Plus）\n- @version: 3.1.1 → 3.1.2\n\n新增 3 个 daterange 测试：EP 数组、EP 单值、EU 通用。\n\nCo-A