,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/9366182541695bc2e36f7d5bdd101a28caa7099a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:10:22Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:10:22Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(element-plus): el-checkbox 用 click() 模拟用户操作\n\n之前 input.checked = true + dispatchEvent(''change'') 的方式可能在某些\nElement Plus 版本不触发 v-model 更新（特别是当 @change 监听器在\n原生 click 之后才注册或绑定方式不同时）。\n\n改用 input.click() 让浏览器原生切换 checked + 触发 change/input 事件链，\n这是 Element Plus 期望的真实交互路径。增加 fallback：click() 未切换\n时强制设置 + 手动 dispatch。\n\nfillElCheckboxGroup 也同步使用 click() 方式。\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"055c747d4b951b73e93f06e93a72545862bbac62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/055c747d4b951b73e93f06e93a72545862bbac62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/9366182541695bc2e36f7d5bdd101a28caa7099a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"ht