ttps://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/dc48a2034c3d71015d568100bad28c2bf0af02b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:48:45Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:48:45Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"fix(element-plus): 兼容 Element Plus 2.6+ 新版 Select 结构\n\nElement Plus 2.6 把 el-select 内部结构从 .el-input/.el-input__inner\n重构为 .el-select__wrapper/.el-select__input，旧选择器失效。\n\n修改：\n- elSelectInput 改为 ''.el-input__inner, .el-select__input'' 兼容两版本\n- 新增 elSelectWrapper 选择器，fillElSelect 点 wrapper 而不是 readonly input\n- elSelectItem 兼容 .el-select-v2__list-item 与 li.el-vl__item\n- elDatePicker / elDatePickerInput 也兼容新结构\n- buildMockElSelect 加 version: ''v26'' 选项 + 3 个新结构测试\n\n测试：95/95 通过（新增 3 个 Element Plus 2.6+ 场景）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a01bbad2916595332e84e60d620270d7f9155c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/a01bbad2916595332e84e60d620270d7f9155c6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/dc48a2034c3d71015d568100bad28c2bf0af02b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/world