上下文，\nwindow/document 是沙箱的，导致浮动按钮 document.body.appendChild 不会\n显示到页面 DOM 中。\n\n修复：\n- @grant 改回 none，脚本直接跑在页面上下文\n- 去掉 GM_registerMenuCommand 菜单命令（none 模式下不可用）\n- 新增 Ctrl+Alt+C 快捷键打开配置页（与填充快捷键分离）\n- 浮动按钮 z-index 提到 2147483647，添加 hover 动效\n- README 增加故障排查章节\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87de3be61dcb4934baeaafd5423052b30b428645","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/87de3be61dcb4934baeaafd5423052b30b428645"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/95bf0a667931f3a0ad4039b04f4765bed4e29041","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/95bf0a667931f3a0ad4039b04f4765bed4e29041","node_id":"C_kwDOE-3HJNoAKDk1YmYwYTY2NzkzMWYzYTBhZDQwMzliMDRmNDc2NWJlZDRlMjkwNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/357a48d2a8bed2d8cfbde2afe1ae978f3a642ecb","sha":"357a48d2a8bed2d8cfbde2afe1ae978f3a642ecb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/357a48d2a8bed2d8cfbde2afe1ae978f3a642ecb"}],"sha":"95bf0a667931f3a0ad4039b04f4765bed4e29041","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/95bf0a667931f3a0ad4039b04f4765bed4e29041"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/commits/357a48d2a8bed2d8cfbde2afe1ae978f3a642ecb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T02:07:38Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T02:07:38Z","email":"qq1132416@outlook.com","name":"worldluoji"},"message":"refactor(form-autofill): 重构为模块化 + 可视化配置页\n\n把原 form_atuo_fill.md 里的 IIFE 脚本重构为 src/ ES Modules + esbuild 打包。\n\n- 新增填充器 Strategy 模式：native + element-plus，覆盖原生表单 +\n  el-input / el-select / el-cascader / el-date-picker / el-checkbox(-group) /\n  el-radio(-group) / el-switch / el-slider 等组件\n- 用原生 HTMLInputElement.prototype.value setter 绕过 Vue/React 的 patch，\n  触发 input 事件让 v-model 响应\n- 填充标记从 el[flag] 改为 WeakSet，不再污染 DOM\n- 配置三级合并：window.__AUTOFILL_CONFIG__ > localStorage > DEFAULT_CONFIG\n- 新增可视化配置页（Shadow DOM 隔离 + localStorage 持久化）\n  入口：油猴菜单命令 + 右下角浮动按钮\n  功能：14 种字段类型编辑器、导入导出 JSON、恢复默认、测试填充\n- 新增 92 个 Vitest 单测（matchers / dom-utils / native / element-plus /\n  core / config-storage / config-types / config-ui）\n- 新增 README.md 说明使用方法与配置项\n- 重命名 form_atuo_fill.md → form_auto_fill.md（修正拼写）\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bfa8894046b9a45577638b56ba8cb4ff3b52dcac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/trees/bfa8894046b9a45577638b56ba8cb4ff3b52dcac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/worldluoji/front-end/git/commits/357a48d2a8bed2d8cfbde2afe1ae978f3a642ecb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42109500?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji","id":42109500,"login":"worldluoji","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMTA5NTAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/worldluoji","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/worldluoji/front-end/commit/357a48d2a8bed2d8cfbde2afe1ae978f3a642ecb","node_id":"C_kwDOE-3HJNoAKDM1N2E0OGQyYThiZWQyZDhjZmJkZTJhZmUxYWU5NzhmM2E2NDJlY2I",