d_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/berfinyuksel","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/95545432cd526f08bde0d53136b603c4c16e3aba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:54:26Z","email":"99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com","name":"berfinyuksel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:54:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Pass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#708)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f68b66117dd4949116694b0470dab563b4af429a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/trees/f68b66117dd4949116694b0470dab563b4af429a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/commits/95545432cd526f08bde0d53136b603c4c16e3aba","verification":{"payload":"tree f68b66117dd4949116694b0470dab563b4af429a\nparent 523aaadf744a05bf1391f26f1f7c00a309a91c04\nauthor berfinyuksel <99557970+berfinyuksel@users.noreply.github.com> 1791395666 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791395666 +0200\n\nPass SYNC_TOKEN to the studio frontend build (#708)\n\nPart of pimcore/DevOps-Tasks#65. The studio frontend build pushes its automatic commits as pimcore-deployments and only on pushes to version branches; PR runs upload the build as an artifact instead (pimcore/workflows-collection-public#168). The push run no longer cancels an in-progress run; the head-commit check in the reusable prevents a commit loop.\n\nUntil #168 is merged the \"Studio Frontend Build\" check fails at startup with \"secret SYNC_TOKEN is not defined in the referenced workflow\". That is expected; the check gets re-run after the merge, before this PR is marked ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxodSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2QkQAKaO1zQgrFlrpzhjIkwyrUG9\nqcqZAbpODfP5Vzil70pctGAdSAKTyx3IY1u0g1VxFNII08l/KWAHYoOinwM8aqYP\nVDSfw7fSbUdnPSWWPN/L91JqStDyLvqsHl6YZSPmHxhNjRWrdLAxVdLPingrOvki\nS7aGDx7288/t5mX1o98ruN/IhWEB4gOb4dsyWjiHtnDgFcpEiwl/8cXqhLV6OxiT\nILGv573o/Dyzch7DKhnRZjR8SOVVCwkOVgYuida3pGTivB3FqM52x0IApIUaijzp\n7MPGUpAFzHhztO91x7Fvn+E8JCuwEs6SebItN4ssZzLyFVg2wGY1df3dAQwRwa5R\nI+/PTFf9cJ8WqhQLRpOK10oENELrKnHiSByiurGq2QHNKml3ijxWR/PX7i6S9Ol8\nIVSSTapX3pTtRP59A4rTOUx58bpUHSuZUb9HkHTfRQ87szEOOXGzpIW6g6W9s68b\nGk6mW8sRmau7j//d4hL0OgrvL8ODaBGi3fII4s3CVwbNQJ+2LKduP4uySMJZDmQG\ndnNS6PD7U74Lz5eFaDKQ6b4Ku8Yfi+tRev+76XVBieoGRT5DKH3nhHQw0VrtBMFP\nRHvhQn7DyEDuFFtvE/F03Pn77Q6bqCmfd/azAwNdBxfkdT3qaUtZ2qXybLMzntMe\nGxUMDvj9WvCvUtgHd9zm\n=nuLK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-07T17:54:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/g