,"sha":"ba094031e23eb092d5c9c76a841d127b7fb2b6b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/ba094031e23eb092d5c9c76a841d127b7fb2b6b2"}],"sha":"bf0b11cbe9888567658e17e4caa04c66d828454d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/bf0b11cbe9888567658e17e4caa04c66d828454d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1744861?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ellenico77","id":1744861,"login":"ellenico77","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDQ4NjE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ellenico77","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/ba094031e23eb092d5c9c76a841d127b7fb2b6b2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:41:50Z","email":"1744861+ellenico77@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lorenzo Nicoletti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:41:50Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Improve: allow PreSaveEvent listeners to skip default object persistence (#607)\n\nA PreSaveEvent listener can now call setSkipSave(true) to stop the import from persisting the current element. The element is not saved, no PostSaveEvent is dispatched, the skip is written to the import log, and an existing element is reloaded so its unsaved changes cannot leak into a later row.\n\nCloses pimcore/platform-version#303","tree":{"sha":"0e02ee8397be273c809726f998d606a2bba31a84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/trees/0e02ee8397be273c809726f998d606a2bba31a84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/commits/ba094031e23eb092d5c9c76a841d127b7fb2b6b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e02ee8397be273c809726f998d606a2bba31a84\nparent 1248c4e89d791f8e15d1d9480b51ad937bd18c92\nauthor Lorenzo Nicoletti <1744861+ellenico77@users.noreply.github.com> 1789641710 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789641710 +0200\n\nImprove: allow PreSaveEvent listeners to skip default object persistence (#607)\n\nA PreSaveEvent listener can now call setSkipSave(true) to stop the import from persisting the current element. The element is not saved, no PostSaveEvent is dispatched, the skip is written to the import log, and an existing element is reloaded so its unsaved changes cannot leak into a later row.\n\nCloses pimcore/platform-version#303","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq8PuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiDYQAJGXuCarDlBSPUyIxI05FZWZ\nuFQ5kpBZUrqYvzWezMjAzYaLScSy/UiwKj+arcDy3rsyXreZiRXOBYDD2wbzQAwM\nKISY/pJ0YkFwsacc0kGrCVPFwCDC/2iG81gtoNywKbG6ag2fl7PiZDhlTpc62ODo\n9ofpI1Sr2DelGbopJM9LrSljEJCAIPfelp8Uy/Xf2mJZDKt0nBc2xb+g+hj7Tc4z\nGP86ko0ICXYwBiF8oea/lz52E9JddDUSsZ++ZQiVBlknBK2WPSYV6sj3O+kmvJn7\nbcEGVNpkwOzsNcFGgmgseU0Rx+WAVGuEfw2rCF4tICX7R6oxyIDqNWCL9M1veCY7\neUbYPtQYbyxxa1pGdam+VQXS7hxkNq9cF+K0bT4rLRJ8i+6mLkvh6C6guD95YWiM\nvog8bH2J/0ze3op1lGVIYvG7ye41RnHunShi7ui7rw5ZFfp7eRnr3qy5CI+NguLL\nj6gNfvpTjXoC1q2YMwMUH6kympDNYw2032GRo5aP9Nj3vSeSvQWS7j9O4dBLVyhm\n+wapgTX6KJl80X2I4JvyatKPhPX++3+Ma5NFQSmozsX7gHigHtwoGRJaudbqLpSK\nhHKlHCLZurHac2tIbypUJ2e5bDYOnxw8v5/xXgfqhVgGUlufZR9iXSBTojTp2EQW\n2ASN+OeVvVNgFFccgEOu\n=XvvS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T10:41:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.git