n":"xIrusux","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMzU5NjE1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xIrusux","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/1248c4e89d791f8e15d1d9480b51ad937bd18c92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:23:59Z","email":"42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Tine"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T12:23:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"3207 - [Data Importer] - Translations (nl, pl) (#697)\n\n* Add Dutch (nl) and Polish (pl) Studio UI translations\n\nFull translation of studio.en.yaml into nl and pl, consistent with the\nreviewed studio-ui-bundle translations (shared keys and common UI terms\nreuse those exact values; glossary pins kept English: Asset, Object\nBrick, Field Collection, Custom Layout, Layout, Workspace). Validated\nwith the studio i18n skill validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Polish grammar fixes and Classification Store alignment\n\n- pl: make \"Pole\" the grammatical subject of the generic validation\n  messages, so they stay correct for field labels of any gender.\n- pl: \"Atrybuty zrodlowe\" instead of a parenthetical that cannot agree\n  with both numbers.\n- nl+pl: keep the Classification Store product name in English, as all\n  six existing locales in this bundle already do.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1c81abac9ab062969cc1f02b760c9d41ed0a2788","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/trees/1c81abac9ab062969cc1f02b760c9d41ed0a2788"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/commits/1248c4e89d791f8e15d1d9480b51ad937bd18c92","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c81abac9ab062969cc1f02b760c9d41ed0a2788\nparent 2428b034699702545cc684f3e9e5a9cdbb3e9f90\nauthor Tine <42359615+xIrusux@users.noreply.github.com> 1789561439 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789561439 +0200\n\n3207 - [Data Importer] - Translations (nl, pl) (#697)\n\n* Add Dutch (nl) and Polish (pl) Studio UI translations\n\nFull translation of studio.en.yaml into nl and pl, consistent with the\nreviewed studio-ui-bundle translations (shared keys and common UI terms\nreuse those exact values; glossary pins kept English: Asset, Object\nBrick, Field Collection, Custom Layout, Layout, Workspace). Validated\nwith the studio i18n skill validator.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Polish grammar fixes and Classification Store alignment\n\n- pl: make \"Pole\" the grammatical subject of the generic validation\n  messages, so they stay correct for field labels of any gender.\n- pl: \"Atrybuty zrodlowe\" instead of a parenthetical that cannot agree\n  with both numbers.\n- nl+pl: keep the Classification Store product name in English, as all\n  six existing locales in this bundle already do.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqopfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwdYQAEIc+EPg5UV0tMAl26PyuS3c\ndqKOZCiBYei8fJ8NjvtUTO0MBXoaF/LrCSg+YQ7zvVvkfGbV4023YZa/Xeb6lm7O\n6LBOtODRpXzN5VaFR2nJyQsH6PR6OlWXa2stabCx6geUKiOUy1g3dO4GmgqzamwE\n0jDVF7j8lWBdNmbwioF1aHa7oWHkl28RyPS3vXur/cTV4gm5L8/VxR2y7NIY420g\nD7xd5Hciz/uspXBnFdnGAY+NuJNKk6DAjTFjtVhdAuBuFVkbEyuUxmK7h2AIpuGp\n1hRh2hcNZ53Vqip4+RQ8EaSkKhY7luVBRYfGM3cS2nOzHYsgd+OL5xBIkrK5VhhR\n/tSYKKrFnfuQlTlLtFr4xmABeoRl4wV