itter":{"date":"2026-09-02T14:50:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[Import Logs] Hide tab when application logger bundle is not installed or enabled (2.4 backport of #672) (#688)\n\n* [Import Logs] Hide tab when application logger bundle is not installed or enabled (2.4 backport of #672)\n\nBackport of cfb57b3 to the 2.4 LTS line. The import-logs tab reads its\ndata through the studio-backend-bundle application-logger endpoint, so\nit is only offered when PimcoreApplicationLoggerBundle is enabled and\ninstalled; otherwise the tab rendered but could never load data.\n\nRequires the isBundleActive helper from the studio-ui-bundle 2025.4\nbackport of pimcore/studio-ui-bundle#3980. The\n@pimcore/studio-ui-bundle npm dependency in assets/studio/package.json\nstill needs to be bumped to the first 2025.4 canary that ships the\nhelper once it is published - until then the studio frontend build of\nthis branch cannot compile.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#145\n\n(cherry picked from commit cfb57b379ede4f282eecc36a43e075fc0e570c43)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Resolve isBundleActive at runtime so the 2.4 build stands alone\n\nOn the 2025.4 LTS line the isBundleActive SDK helper only exists once\npimcore/studio-ui-bundle#4074 ships, so the static import made this\nbranch depend on an unpublished package. Resolve the helper from the\nfederated app module at runtime instead: on an older studio-ui host the\ntab stays offered (previous behavior), on a host with the helper it is\nhidden when PimcoreApplicationLoggerBundle is inactive.\n\nVerified against the currently published @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle\n^1.0.0 canary: tsc --noEmit clean, eslint clean, rsbuild production\nbuild succeeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ddc179a1a621f16d993bc220b93369b64661d6a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/trees/ddc179a1a621f16d993bc220b93369b64661d6a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/commits/daaafddf8f9c8421fc944c08b3ebdb8811a20385","verification":{"payload":"tree ddc179a1a621f16d993bc220b93369b64661d6a0\nparent 29338912e399b0402d8fa4a9ddc713918fcfdb46\nauthor Valeriia Maltseva <valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com> 1788360649 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788360649 +0200\n\n[Import Logs] Hide tab when application logger bundle is not installed or enabled (2.4 backport of #672) (#688)\n\n* [Import Logs] Hide tab when application logger bundle is not installed or enabled (2.4 backport of #672)\n\nBackport of cfb57b3 to the 2.4 LTS line. The import-logs tab reads its\ndata through the studio-backend-bundle application-logger endpoint, so\nit is only offered when PimcoreApplicationLoggerBundle is enabled and\ninstalled; otherwise the tab rendered but could never load data.\n\nRequires the isBundleActive helper from the studio-ui-bundle 2025.4\nbackport of pimcore/studio-ui-bundle#3980. The\n@pimcore/studio-ui-bundle npm dependency in assets/studio/package.json\nstill needs to be bumped to the first 2025.4 canary that ships the\nhelper once it is published - until then the studio frontend build of\nthis branch cannot compile.\n\nFixes pimcore/platform-version#145\n\n(cherry picked from commit cfb57b379ede4f282eecc36a43e075fc0e570c43)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Resolve isBundleActive at runtime so the 2.4 build stands alone\n\nOn the 2025.4 LTS line the isBundleActive SDK helper only exists once\npimcore/studio-ui-bundle#4074 ships, so the static import made this\nbranch depend on an unpublished package. Resolve the helper from the\nfederated app module at runtime instead: on an older studio-ui host the\ntab stays offered (previous behavior), on a host with the helper it is\nhidden when PimcoreApplicationLoggerBundle is inactive.\n\nVerified against the currently published @pimcore/studio-ui-bundle\n^1.0.0 canary: tsc --noEmit clean, eslint clean, rsbuild production\nbuild succeeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmDfJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzkUQAEvFH6loksGT/5hO6PGuvtg9\n20lKYjV2xat17y3QxzDYALZ89CJZ54WP/+RUMc8nU5yd8fWgpE1O3QD8V4vv3Gch\nkw0EFii6VXkEt1LM0ydfgnreGX9GBZPF2r/fGSYmBomUV95M/09RRqPgc3LN7kFT\nVph5n+SK6NaH6P11KbAMmHkzCIowDJe+tpLuYiRY3ZqLsml4hQ3RnG1XkAkX4NT0\nzv6iloxlpQavDYPRz0liamvFDyE3/Vgx+FvOJiJ2gWvH98bkZYYx7g8Nd6Zd+Bms\nVgX7Kd3+NNGFlm5jxe32PthtHSclBAxscjtjj0SSF3CIFZrcHPqV2+vdahIpO8qJ\nXS6YfuFv+S5lpWJc/scVg8X/YAIy+Ecp+m1COgVFS1+RsWJDclvAqw4VJakTBLkQ\nbDq1g/tq75zObJszN+VnmeSNN8BtOsCc+a7PtKq6lrds2wpFacJl00MKGX3pAhdk\nv3pH0v3MsC8SSDqYSrD1qHPbOfSX9Gul211ERc6L35KDFMnUcNAzispQP0UlDdB2\naoc5XLaxzgUD1+F+xthIsA+p06oW+osZfnlLpoWfftrQ2NIssSmzCwcidAvSeayq\nPwIrOCtWKep17g5cw6lPU19S2ToK7qHMLHLiwCx1U7+hyeTWSFxTismy2cWTFVXF\niEYiPlhay0C2HZi1Zewu\n=nN9J\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-02T14:50:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/follo