s/ValeriaMaltseva/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ValeriaMaltseva","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/67913f9881691b3191e6f7b20d8e905df9da4b75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:51:16Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-02T12:51:16Z","email":"valeriia.maltseva@pimcore.com","name":"Valeriia Maltseva"},"message":"Merge branch ''2026.2'' into 2026.x\n\nBrings the swagger-php Generator::$context fix from 2026.2 (33955b3) forward.\nKept 2026.x''s own docs.jsonopenapi.json, generated API client, .php-cs-fixer.cache\nand Studio build directory as-is (regenerated per environment, not merge content).\n\nManually reconciled tests/unit/UnitDataResponseTest.php: kept 2026.x''s\ndocumentedPropertyNames() helper and the two OpenAPI-snapshot/generated-client\ndrift tests, but rewrote the helper''s reflection logic to use the safe\ngetArguments() + defensive Generator::$context initialization from 2026.2,\ninstead of the newInstance()/Generator::isDefault() pattern that throws on\nswagger-php''s \"lowest\" dependency matrix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"064165dc80a58dd729cb4a827abac918feff250d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/trees/064165dc80a58dd729cb4a827abac918feff250d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/commits/67913f9881691b3191e6f7b20d8e905df9da4b75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11871778?v=4","events_