ew() forwards each interpreter value unchanged\n(src/Preview/Model/PreviewData.php:52-57); JsonFileInterpreter reads rows\nstraight from json_decode, so a cell''s value can be a string, number,\nboolean, array, object, or null. The frontend already accounts for this at\nevery consumer of the generated type: normalize-data-row.ts explicitly\nstringifies non-string values, preview-import-step.tsx:157 does the same,\nand use-preview-record-query.ts:114 casts the response to\nArray<Record<string, any>> to escape the incorrect string type.\n\nReverted the annotation to unconstrained (no `type` key = arbitrary JSON\nvalue per JSON Schema), matching the pre-307aeb9 shape, and patched the\nsnapshot + regenerated the client the same way as 59ee843 since\nbugfix.nightly.pimcore.app has not redeployed this fix yet. check-types\nis unaffected outside the intended `data?: any` change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n* Automatic frontend build\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: ValeriaMaltseva <11871778+ValeriaMaltseva@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: github-actions[bot] <41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJql/5aCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAARuQQAE4C10to0rn8nIpsIm7Qhs2k\naIGYECw0GaU7PIY2JwElQY9RB78z4ixuglR7eDTcBexMAZgPpnEpcjBhqUUb6CFg\nDAyU3cpcP0XfWie7pRbNHsr1o/X9d8yjniEXmp0zMe8dIzg0CgQc+hBCCb6OCFFY\nwEdIdqc5wrIpJheHGpXYp6LhKKPjvfuC79xrNSOuaEDG8g98teB94tKTrekpzAgr\nsdfD0E4hhBdI60eUdrP8fNdPhqImJu9Q7vTwik7S5V/FEBG8oy0fqB6vS9hTMU+Y\nyDg5e83Ha5PLsas5Acy7qMyEdvaaRzeKJBfrn55XwQpoNZ+T9azBfrCeqbkk4rsd\nPCvajWo8sQwA2KmiyoNGBOr9Mq/0hlkyVXDacYr77sT7DJoib4tDC2Fm6bONH88R\nZRa/X1DgVV+qq6kdfOjxfSVnWTw0IEaJhm65AOsTKgc8LjjKuFNVlEFvqVBKWRnQ\nAIzV5x0MCLJYjGFqLUdOiy/1WkFH9bmt2iJWwcLJ8avSoUtu670G8Lxf54EYXEzz\nU3WSz9RUROrbQeKvJ6TTYl2SlPIadnOjhpCl9IIhf5ZfKkkwk4sC27qe