"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jcPimcore","id":259032526,"login":"jcPimcore","node_id":"U_kgDOD3CFzg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcPimcore","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/commits/c1c31a1034f0f9bd5439548ac0e9e566ce653ce8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-14T09:13:02Z","email":"jochen.califice@pimcore.com","name":"JochenC"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-14T09:13:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix PHPStan: drop dead null-coalesce on listWorksheetInfo() result (#676)\n\nphpoffice/phpspreadsheet types listWorksheetInfo() as returning\narray{worksheetName: string, lastColumnLetter: string, ...} where every\nkey always exists and is non-nullable. The `?? null` / `?? 0` / `?? ''A''`\nfallbacks introduced in #661 are therefore flagged by PHPStan (highest)\nas dead code, failing static-analysis CI on 2026.2 after merge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"03c95b5dcd3e59f8e0d84138ce1832c6af9a0095","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/trees/03c95b5dcd3e59f8e0d84138ce1832c6af9a0095"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pimcore/data-importer/git/commits/c1c31a1034f0f9bd5439548ac0e9e566ce653ce8","verification":{"payload":"tree 03c95b5dcd3e59f8e0d84138ce1832c6af9a0095\nparent 3b4052b7aefe60037e07ffacc3b7e8373eafeb65\nauthor JochenC <jochen.califice@pimcore.com> 1786698782 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786698782 +0200\n\nFix PHPStan: drop dead null-coalesce on listWorksheetInfo() result (#676)\n\nphpoffice/phpspreadsheet types listWorksheetInfo() as returning\narray{worksheetName: string, lastColumnLetter: string, ...} where every\nkey always exists and is non-nullable. The `?? null` / `?? 0` / `?? ''A''`\nfallbacks introduced in #661 are therefore flagged by PHPStan (highest)\nas dead code, failing static-analysis CI on 2026.2 after merge.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqftweCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgTcQAKjD8MawPMc5yiYeQS2S7nWZ\ne/FF2V7HO8uLx1MvPuFWW8nAUyLzSIfivHhS7N/DtS9sgYdtw5OBNoUMy8H+WwPt\nGaJCcpvwtRy0StHwI6NXxqnhFco3n0ZZCEiIVPUUBWM+8HT862LeIed/Odz62JoA\n1kIGEFmTfHnmuPPvWidABLbz0r3Be6SqDuUJwF6ehqZivE1ik+eKA6zxhrnR6OAS\njFlAFDMGf2Xs5z8K5wa9lZwDnf+3599grGOW49ScloCcpclfkodgvOuHrdH/kIap\nxtzj/nM59eUumwgxpqsKDLKN3/hNEoTkiSb1yr4IzTwuGXidOHzUdNvuQJaiyxrI\nCTRPzsj64gfZXfoUwh1pdZ+1YMWRUP4y4g2mlhUBqbuyKzwDopcNcb4NW9y64Xw1\njs9vdUtyGLKER+oBlTRDQCWOgKDqfcfPkrJRA0S1tH9bFwgc55bulN9iW37RtXwc\nazzpblWfX2kaSFLiI3q8S1xUVuo6C5w6wWZI5NNzsO2zcaeH1Nk+uf0vjmdHGVO5\ntMxtDY1gio4N0qRWMLXeL9j+iKJ5KxicnciwTsSxFqX/iZq0Rx/tJaUUJmWx0Mgi\nC9W6pwAt4NJ7UubfuJvomcq/ifhoXMMM2CUuqTGPaa03d4J0RRMkweQG6BUh7QwX\nCVf3Ff1Ir6P13ghUyE/g\n=c+Yg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-14T09:13:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flo