illo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:26:11Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Live log of services put off: no service writes a log file today\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"93a4b3175d88c87aa9027593735d13437f28cf4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/93a4b3175d88c87aa9027593735d13437f28cf4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/5a1f5a48e8160712137e71d645355be457ba3bab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/5a1f5a48e8160712137e71d645355be457ba3bab","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDVhMWY1YTQ4ZTgxNjA3MTIxMzdlNzFkNjQ1MzU1YmU0NTdiYTNiYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c","sha":"96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c"}],"sha":"5a1f5a48e8160712137e71d645355be457ba3bab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/5a1f5a48e8160712137e71d645355be457ba3bab"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:11:31Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:11:31Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel: Windows services, in one area with processes and connections\n\nThe services the Worker Control watches get a screen of their own, with\ntheir state, health and actions, and are chosen from what the machine has\ninstalled. Applications and Worker Control become one area of the menu.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f2764cc588b2adb7974b4e04f7b493ff0cdec5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/9f2764cc588b2adb7974b4e04f7b493ff0cdec5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDk2ZGM4NDkzMGNkMjgwNWQzOTQ1NzhhNjQ5ZWQ0MzE4MTNhZDA4OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf","sha":"338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf"}],"sha":"96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/96dc84930cd2805d394578a649ed431813ad088c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:49:15Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T14:49:15Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Monitoring of the environment: proposed specification\n\nWindows services, HTTP traffic measured at the reverse proxy and micro\nfrontends, collected by the Worker Control and shown in the panel.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c43e01688f930ee2741cb9eecb8c2fe1823deb3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/c43e01688f930ee2741cb9eecb8c2fe1823deb3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDMzOGEwMDk5MjBjMGRlNDhiNWViZmM1NDhhMDI4NTMzOGU5MTcwYmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4","sha":"729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4"}],"sha":"338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/338a009920c0de48b5ebfc548a0285338e9170bf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:40:32Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:40:32Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel: the trace of a whole group at once\n\nThere is no telling which process of a group will take a message, so the\nlines of all of them come together, in the order they were written, over\none request. A process that is replaced joins by itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0647d3a5a873d463df91b63bd4b9dd6eaa7d2358","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/0647d3a5a873d463df91b63bd4b9dd6eaa7d2358"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDcyOWEzN2M3ZTYzY2UwZjdjNzc5OWJlNTc4NWRlODg0MjQ5NDhjYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2","sha":"063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2"}],"sha":"729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/729a37c7e63ce0f7c7799be5785de88424948ca4"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:13:22Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:13:22Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel: the trace of a supervised process, live\n\nWatching is what turns the trace on in the process; the lines travel in\nqueues the broker treats as disposable, and nothing of them is kept. A\nprocess that only knows the trace of 1.x is asked for through the Worker\nControl.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"474ac204fbc8527cbd3dc0836460b9eea59478f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/474ac204fbc8527cbd3dc0836460b9eea59478f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDA2M2IxZmJhZDI4NzQ1ZjJlODlhODFjZjYzZmE1NWI0MTZkZDc1YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51","sha":"50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51"}],"sha":"063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/063b1fbad28745f2e89a81cf63fa55b416dd75c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:36:12Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:36:12Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel, third step: the map\n\nWho publishes in and consumes from each queue, drawn in columns, with the\nstate of every part and the Worker Control over what it keeps running. The\nbroker now remembers who published in a queue for a day, and whoever reads\nchooses how far back to look.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62a09658ce8fb6cf0d48f69e5ad9f1bac1df3f79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/62a09658ce8fb6cf0d48f69e5ad9f1bac1df3f79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDUwYTBhZTQxNjYxYzhiM2IyYmRmM2ZjZjE5MWMwYzJmNTRlZGNmNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78","sha":"a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78"}],"sha":"50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/50a0ae41661c8b3b2bdf3fcf191c0c2f54edcf51"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:04:19Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:04:19Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel, second step: the Worker Control section\n\nThe panel asks the Worker Control through the broker, on the queue\nWorkerControlAdmin, so the two may be on different machines and nothing has\nto be configured. Screens: groups and processes live, with the health of\neach process; history of events; ConfigWorkers.json in forms or as text.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e03681ad53e36ee4bc2afaa79ea6f67d63cab86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/0e03681ad53e36ee4bc2afaa79ea6f67d63cab86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKGEzNjZhMmQyODBjNzYyODhlZDJjODdhNjMyMGMwZjJlNzRiMzJiNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1","sha":"fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1"}],"sha":"a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/a366a2d280c76288ed2c87a6320c0f2e74b32b78"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:28:12Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:28:12Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"README: the reverse proxy block has to win over locations by file extension\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33fd51a01cf200341aef9f1fdada6a22499d0c7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/33fd51a01cf200341aef9f1fdada6a22499d0c7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKGZkY2VmY2IwNWQ1ZDNlNDQ4NmRkNDJjOTM0M2Y4ZGIyMThhMmQwYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15","sha":"424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15"}],"sha":"fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/fdcefcb05d5d3e4486dd42c9343f8db218a2d0b1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:10Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:33:10Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel, first step: the interface for the broker\n\nAn Angular 22 application with Angular Material and ECharts, compiled into\nthe service executable. Screens: overview with indicators and charts of the\nlast hour and day; queues, live, each with its editable definition, pending\nmessages, publishers and consumers, and the pause, resume and empty actions;\ndead letters to inspect, send back or discard; connected applications.\n\nIt adapts from a phone to a wide monitor, has light and dark themes and\nloads nothing from the internet: fonts and icons are bundled.\n\npublish.sh / publish.ps1 build the interface and then the service with it\ninside. Version 2.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e72375f854861163aee1e50325f341845e205ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/5e72375f854861163aee1e50325f341845e205ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDQyNGZmZjNjNTZiYzYzNmY5ZDk1MDgwYTU1ZTgxOWM3NzVkOTRlMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/9c77bd78809b824a121ed9f33c13ad8270eb23b6","sha":"9c77bd78809b824a121ed9f33c13ad8270eb23b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/9c77bd78809b824a121ed9f33c13ad8270eb23b6"}],"sha":"424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/424fff3c56bc636f9d95080a55e819c775d94e15"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/9c77bd78809b824a121ed9f33c13ad8270eb23b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:18:31Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T02:18:31Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Panel, server side: a port of its own, login and the API the interface is built on\n\n- The panel answers on its own port (5680), at the root and under a base path\n  for a reverse proxy. Nothing of it answers on the messaging port; the /admin\n  routes moved there, behind the login.\n- Login with a user and password from the settings and a signed session cookie.\n- API: overview, series for the charts (a reading every 5 s for an hour, one\n  per minute for a day), queues with their messages, publishers and consumers,\n  queue definitions written to queues.json, dead letters, connections, and a\n  server-sent stream with the state of the broker.\n- Core: a queue can be paused, looked into and emptied; the broker records who\n  publishes to and asks from each queue, and counts totals that survive the\n  queues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6774e75d76d2c7f56d8838e7487e903c70533dc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/6774e75d76d2c7f56d8838e7487e903c70533dc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/9c77bd78809b824a121ed9f33c13ad8270eb23b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/9c77bd78809b824a121ed9f33c13ad8270eb23b6","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKDljNzdiZDc4ODA5YjgyNGExMjFlZDlmMzNjMTNhZDgyNzBlYjIzYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/62e3f0b791856104dd315f46a1879d4dcceaa9be","sha":"62e3f0b791856104dd3