the 2.x installer script\n\nThe 1.x routes no longer refuse a TTL above 65535 ms. The service writes a\ndaily diagnostic log next to the executable and publishes as a single\nself-contained ZapMQ.exe. The Inno Setup script installs it as a Windows\nservice and replaces a 1.x installation; it has not been compiled yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"20d53d5acb1c530fad8c3fef069c239a16fbb079","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/20d53d5acb1c530fad8c3fef069c239a16fbb079"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/fc42b483a09422af5858b42496f6060d0552b8d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/fc42b483a09422af5858b42496f6060d0552b8d2","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKGZjNDJiNDgzYTA5NDIyYWY1ODU4YjQyNDk2ZjYwNjBkMDU1MmI4ZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77","sha":"bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77"}],"sha":"fc42b483a09422af5858b42496f6060d0552b8d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/fc42b483a09422af5858b42496f6060d0552b8d2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:07:47Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:07:47Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Use appsettings.json and keep 1.x quirks inside the compatibility layer\n\nAnswering an undelivered message is now opt-in and only the 1.x routes ask\nfor it. Configuration moves to the standard appsettings.json; ZapMQ.ini is\nno longer read.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cc38472e0f5a9f925edadc8c6c4b96931f8585e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/8cc38472e0f5a9f925edadc8c6c4b96931f8585e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKGJiMGJlNWRmMTRhYzI5OGFkN2ZlMGE3NWNiYTZkODk2M2VmYzBlNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43","sha":"ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43"}],"sha":"bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/bb0be5df14ac298ad7fe0a75cba6d8963efc0e77"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:03:09Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T19:03:09Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Match the 1.x server answer for answer, verified against a recorded contract\n\nAdds the contract recorder and 89 answers recorded from a running Delphi\nserver. The compatibility layer now reproduces them exactly: required\nfields, TTL validation, RPC responses before delivery, parameter count\nerrors, verb handling, JSON escaping and response headers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b3b940173e37e628e4c576d5370794008db2762d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/b3b940173e37e628e4c576d5370794008db2762d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/commits/ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43","node_id":"C_kwDOFCYvy9oAKGVhMzcyNmJkN2Y1NzdhNDIzM2ZjZWNiMzY0ZGNkZjI1MmVmMjVjNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commit/51f986e4ffe17ffa87541356cbddb2cdc094fcd5","sha":"51f986e4ffe17ffa87541356cbddb2cdc094fcd5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/51f986e4ffe17ffa87541356cbddb2cdc094fcd5"}],"sha":"ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/ea3726bd7f577a4233fcecb364dcdf252ef25c43"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/commits/51f986e4ffe17ffa87541356cbddb2cdc094fcd5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:51:38Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T18:51:38Z","email":"murillo@MacBook-Air-de-Murillo.local","name":"Murillo Rodrigues Lazzaretti"},"message":"Add the server with the 1.x DataSnap compatibility layer\n\nWindows service host on Kestrel, port read from ZapMQ.json or the 1.x\nZapMQ.ini, the four TZapMethods routes, /health and /metrics. Covered by\nraw HTTP tests and by the unmodified 1.x .NET wrapper.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf336a467a66107f1659d5055d05867a39fa9976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MurilloLazzaretti/ZapMQ/git/trees/cf336a467a66107f1659d5055d05867a39fa9976"},"url":"htt