blic"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/789d801b65a4ba78d08541a0dc6767c3806ec124/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:29:11Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-19T23:29:11Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"message":"fix(collectstory): fix card height, image sizing and explore layout shift\n\n- Collection cards (/[username]): add height: 100% to public and owner\n  card links so all cards in a grid row stretch to equal height and\n  margin-top: auto reliably pins the meta row to the bottom.\n- Item cards (/[username]/[collectionSlug]): replace flex: 1 with\n  width: 100% on the card link to fix flex-basis: 0% collapsing the\n  width; use position: absolute + inset: 0 on item images to prevent the\n  design-system height: auto base class from competing with fill rules.\n- Item line: always render the element with a non-breaking space fallback\n  so cards without a line name do not shift adjacent cards.\n- Explore Collection: add a stable aspect-ratio wrapper with height: 70vh\n  and a shimmer placeholder so the layout never shifts while the image\n  loads; extract useEagerItemPages, useKeyboardNav and useSwipe hooks to\n  reduce component complexity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2a1fa4c9acaccbe0c44a987f722287e9f72f1d7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/2a1fa4c9acaccbe0c44a987f722287e9f72f1d7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/789d801b65a4ba78d08541a0dc6767c3806ec124","verification":{"payload":"tree 2a1fa4c9acaccbe0c44a987f722287e9f72f1d7d\nparent f29507e99db9df8cf6ba88ed594a2e50ef574a4e\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776641351 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776641351 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): fix card height, image sizing and explore layout shift\n\n- Collection cards (/[username]): add height: 100% to public and owner\n  card links so all cards in a grid row stretch to equal height and\n  margin-top: auto reliably pins the meta row to the bottom.\n- Item cards (/[username]/[collectionSlug]): replace flex: 1 with\n  width: 100% on the card link to fix flex-basis: 0% collapsing the\n  width; use position: absolute + inset: 0 on item images to prevent the\n  design-system height: auto base class from competing with fill rules.\n- Item line: always render the element with a non-breaking space fallback\n  so cards without a line name do not shift adjacent cards.\n- Explore Collection: add a stable aspect-ratio wrapper with height: 70vh\n  and a shimmer placeholder so the layout never shifts while the image\n  loads; extract useEagerItemPages, useKeyboardNav and useSwipe hooks to\n  reduce component complexity.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeVlVgAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrMpwAQCJ+EU4qFkqpPM9x4RcT1XXkb66TGdPchWQAeIaQYmc7wEAiKbQmPiYjM4X\nZuBp9/Ajp25JX1PbWkdByG1QyWPzugQ=\n=Hb0f\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-19T23:39:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid","id":1269896,"login":"dezkareid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk4OTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/