QxMDNmYTk3MDBiOTI3YjFkZjJiMTE4NjQ1NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid/dezkareid/commit/79e780c8dbdc9f10380612e1d8e53bcab96c1842","sha":"79e780c8dbdc9f10380612e1d8e53bcab96c1842","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/79e780c8dbdc9f10380612e1d8e53bcab96c1842"}],"sha":"a09b8f27a889d103fa9700b927b1df2b11864545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/a09b8f27a889d103fa9700b927b1df2b11864545"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid","id":1269896,"login":"dezkareid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk4OTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/79e780c8dbdc9f10380612e1d8e53bcab96c1842/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-17T23:16:08Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-17T23:16:08Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"message":"feat(collectstory): context-driven collection page with streaming auth\n\nIntroduce CollectionItemsProvider as the single source of truth for the\ncollection page. Split data fetching into getPublicPageData (no auth, SEO-\nsafe, called in the page body) and getCollectionAuthData (auth-dependent,\ncalled inside CollectionAuthLoader wrapped in <Suspense>) so public content\nis always in the initial HTML while auth data streams in without blocking.\n\nFix several bugs discovered during the refactor:\n- Hooks-order violation in OwnerItemGrid (all hooks now before early return)\n- Slug collision check running on edit (skipped when isEditing=true)\n- Items disappearing after edit (addItems now updates existing items in place\n  and prepends only genuinely new ones)\n- Duplicate ViewTransition names between public and owner grids\n\nRemove server-side RSC wrappers (OwnerItemActions, OwnerCollectionActions)\nthat imported next/headers through barrels into client component bundles,\ncausing \"Pages Router\" bundler errors. NonOwnerItemActions converted to a\nclient component reading from context.\n\nAdd CollectionItemsContext.test.tsx (12 tests) and AddItemForm.test.tsx\n(3 tests). Fix @testing-library/* resolution in vitest.config.mts and\ntsconfig.json by aliasing to the pnpm virtual-store symlinks that were not\nbeing hoisted into the app''s local node_modules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"deab4e9a68b5f44675f36e5b34dc22ee6184d563","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/deab4e9a68b5f44675f36e5b34dc22ee6184d563"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/79e780c8dbdc9f10380612e1d8e53bcab96c1842","verification":{"payload":"tree deab4e9a68b5f44675f36e5b34dc22ee6184d563\nparent 9d9e400b954149b3cdfad9621c82e14a576b0a72\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776467768 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776467768 -0600\n\nfeat(collectstory): context-driven collection page with streaming auth\n\nIntroduce CollectionItemsProvider as the single source of truth for the\ncollection page. Split data fetching into getPublicPageData (no auth, SEO-\nsafe, called in the page body) and getCollectionAuthData (auth-dependent,\ncalled inside CollectionAuthLoader wrapped in <Suspense>) so public content\nis always in the initial HTML while auth data streams in without blocking.\n\nFix several bugs discovered during the refactor:\n- Hooks-order violation in OwnerItemGrid (all hooks now before early return)\n- Slug collision check running on edit (skipped when isEditing=true)\n- Items disappearing after edit (addItems now updates existing items in place\n  and prepends only genuinely new ones)\n- Duplicate ViewTransition names between public and owner grids\n\nRemove server-side RSC wrappers (OwnerItemActions, OwnerCollectionActions)\nthat imported next/headers through barrels into client component bundles,\ncausing \"Pages Router\" bundler errors. NonOwnerItemActions converted to a\nclient component reading from context.\n\nAdd CollectionItemsContext.test.tsx (12 tests) and AddItemForm.test.tsx\n(3 tests). Fix @testing-library/* resolution in vitest.config.mts and\ntsconfig.json by aliasing to the pnpm virtual-store symlinks that were not\nbeing hoisted into the app''s local node_modules.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeK/PQAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrLudAP44Nnf45AoVM6mWrBScxE0Bi9DCMGpkXYew1N0sdAJcjwEA8m49xpjCUuVY\n9Q/TQL4X6AFLuVenNCUqUzZ/Ih9H+ww=\n=exbP\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-17T23:17:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://gith