nt'') consistently on all branches\n(hit and miss). revalidateTag already handles immediate invalidation\nwhen a profile, collection, or item is created — the TTL on the miss\nentry is irrelevant in practice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"176e07fed1a725d445827b0c6739d731569f6baf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/176e07fed1a725d445827b0c6739d731569f6baf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/3cc680dac25623e96189410b467d8710fc5873d0","verification":{"payload":"tree 176e07fed1a725d445827b0c6739d731569f6baf\nparent 7ced303e99780e07bd1f89db2013016de9843270\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776324819 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776324819 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): use full TTL for cache miss in public query helpers\n\ncacheLife({ stale:0, revalidate:60, expire:60 }) on miss was still\ntreated as short-lived/blocking data by Next.js prerender, failing the\n_placeholder route build.\n\nFix: use cacheLife(''user-content'') consistently on all branches\n(hit and miss). revalidateTag already handles immediate invalidation\nwhen a profile, collection, or item is created — the TTL on the miss\nentry is irrelevant in practice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeCQ2QAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrOkWAP4iOy2OnDavm80EbnhwM712hlPl4rWsygcwq60DOR2aZAEAprrqAsRheMPE\nMhgRhdeFV0VKcBi3mAYWMBS7CXWlrwU=\n=QRP6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T07:37:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other