"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/7ced303e99780e07bd1f89db2013016de9843270/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T07:26:36Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T07:26:36Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"message":"fix(collectstory): fix prerender without adding Suspense\n\nThe zero-TTL cacheLife({ stale:0, revalidate:0, expire:0 }) on miss\ncaused Next.js to treat these ''use cache'' functions as uncached/blocking\ndata, breaking prerender of _placeholder routes at build time.\n\nFix: use a short TTL (60s) on miss instead of zero. revalidateTag still\nhandles immediate invalidation when content is created or changed.\nThe 60s window is acceptable — a new collection/profile visible within\na minute without any Suspense wrappers on the public rendering path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1fb9ede30d98eca78b2e163b52fceb0ae755061a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/1fb9ede30d98eca78b2e163b52fceb0ae755061a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/7ced303e99780e07bd1f89db2013016de9843270","verification":{"payload":"tree 1fb9ede30d98eca78b2e163b52fceb0ae755061a\nparent 7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776324396 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776324396 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): fix prerender without adding Suspense\n\nThe zero-TTL cacheLife({ stale:0, revalidate:0, expire:0 }) on miss\ncaused Next.js to treat these ''use cache'' functions as uncached/blocking\ndata, breaking prerender of _placeholder routes at build time.\n\nFix: use a short TTL (60s) on miss instead of zero. revalidateTag still\nhandles immediate invalidation when content is created or changed.\nThe 60s window is acceptable — a new collection/profile visible within\na minute without any Suspense wrappers on the public rendering path.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeCPMwAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrOmtAQCq1bkkdTegUL0RHM0W+0JF9weA9LTmpyjII8bYi0qCEwD/RfRbT9lFvhx0\nqkD2s5Z9eg/kR57xkPZ+0OTMzQ6ZfwQ=\n=siju\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T07:28:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid","id":1269896,"login":"dezkareid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk4OTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid/dezkareid/commit/7ced303e99780e07bd1f89db2013016de9843270","node_id":"C_kwDOFC1MctoAKDdjZWQzMDNlOTk3ODBlMDdiZDFmODlkYjIwMTMwMTZkZTk4NDMyNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid/dezkareid/commit/7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7","sha":"7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7"}],"sha":"7ced303e99780e07bd1f89db2013016de9843270","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/7ced303e99780e07bd1f89db2013016de9843270"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid","id":1269896,"login":"dezkareid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk4OTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T07:24:10Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T07:24:10Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"message":"fix(collectstory): fix prerender build failure on placeholder routes\n\nAll public query functions (getPublicCollectionsByUsername, getPublicCollectionBySlug,\ngetPublicItemBySlug) have a zero-TTL cacheLife branch for missing profiles/collections.\nDuring prerender Next.js uses _placeholder slugs that always hit this branch, causing\n\"Uncached data accessed outside of <Suspense>\" errors at build time.\n\nFix: wrap all components that call these functions in <Suspense> across all three\npages ([username], [collectionSlug], [slug]). Content still streams as server-rendered\nHTML — no SEO impact. The _placeholder prerender completes without blocking errors.\n\nAlso refactors [slug]/page.tsx to use the same static/dynamic split as [collectionSlug]:\n- ItemContent: public cached path, outside Suspense concern resolved via wrapping\n- OwnerPrivateItemGuard: dynamic owner path, always in <Suspense>\n- ItemDetail: shared renderer receiving resolved item + isPrivate flag\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"96b3b0b93bfd8bb140b5b24a8f9c25484fd76692","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/96b3b0b93bfd8bb140b5b24a8f9c25484fd76692"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7","verification":{"payload":"tree 96b3b0b93bfd8bb140b5b24a8f9c25484fd76692\nparent 164b2e546468108fc3a900f5047144edceefe4fb\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776324250 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776324250 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): fix prerender build failure on placeholder routes\n\nAll public query functions (getPublicCollectionsByUsername, getPublicCollectionBySlug,\ngetPublicItemBySlug) have a zero-TTL cacheLife branch for missing profiles/collections.\nDuring prerender Next.js uses _placeholder slugs that always hit this branch, causing\n\"Uncached data accessed outside of <Suspense>\" errors at build time.\n\nFix: wrap all components that call these functions in <Suspense> across all three\npages ([username], [collectionSlug], [slug]). Content still streams as server-rendered\nHTML — no SEO impact. The _placeholder prerender completes without blocking errors.\n\nAlso refactors [slug]/page.tsx to use the same static/dynamic split as [collectionSlug]:\n- ItemContent: public cached path, outside Suspense concern resolved via wrapping\n- OwnerPrivateItemGuard: dynamic owner path, always in <Suspense>\n- ItemDetail: shared renderer receiving resolved item + isPrivate flag\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeCOnQAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrCT6AP43U0bvyleijncFYBU5lraf14ASkKPDICQq/+ZcFXLwPQD+Mnwljlxe2iW5\n9flJ9GyVl9PLKKqpW9vnXZCmRod5eQA=\n=uy58\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T07:28:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid","id":1269896,"login":"dezkareid","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjk4OTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid/dezkareid/commit/7a1f8aba3051b0a5ef8caa800316922adafb81c7","node_id":"C_kwDOFC1MctoAKDdhMWY4YWJhMzA1MWIwYTVlZjhjYWE4MDAzMTY5MjJhZGFmYjgxYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid/dezkareid/commit/164b2e546468108fc3a900f5047144edceefe4fb","sha":"164b2e546468108fc3a900f5047144edceefe4fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/c