laude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b647b86309998588f371f09c8301f7e4dc16324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/9b647b86309998588f371f09c8301f7e4dc16324"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/7c6fcb0cdd53a5cea15fc76847ddbb7427f7cb72","verification":{"payload":"tree 9b647b86309998588f371f09c8301f7e4dc16324\nparent da9ff0e79f90f9422c29dc10da6f758dd74a0d9c\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776321810 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776321810 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): preserve private items after add in owner grid\n\ngetCollectionItems had .eq(''visibility'', ''public'') which caused the\nclient-side grid refresh after adding an item to drop all private\nitems. Removed the visibility filter and added visibility to the select.\n\nReplaced the RSC-to-client privateBadges ReactNode map with a client\nPrivateBadgeOverlay component that reads item.visibility directly.\nThis is simpler and stays correct after any client-side refresh without\nrequiring the RSC parent to re-run.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeCFGQAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrJq9AQDUzw0cHp5yyCtGoVJ/5gw6U1Jrz9lkJZ8vB3HrgmOy3wEAwwdPhZPkFC/k\nwlbH5IG9pni2oSUWvmmlzPzzXkQVmQY=\n=EVRm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T07:13:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dezkareid","id":1269896,"login":"dezkareid","node_id":"