om/users/dezkareid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/commits/da9ff0e79f90f9422c29dc10da6f758dd74a0d9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-16T06:35:07Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-16T06:35:07Z","email":"elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com","name":"Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes"},"message":"fix(collectstory): add private collection fallback to owner action guards\n\nOwnerCollectionActions and OwnerEmptyStateFallback only checked\ngetPublicCollectionBySlug, so the owner''s edit/delete/add buttons\nwere invisible on private collections. Added the same public→owner\nfallback pattern used by OwnerItemActions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cbf568e5c9019bad5a1cf728cde30edbe5d63b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/cbf568e5c9019bad5a1cf728cde30edbe5d63b82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/da9ff0e79f90f9422c29dc10da6f758dd74a0d9c","verification":{"payload":"tree cbf568e5c9019bad5a1cf728cde30edbe5d63b82\nparent 4bf3fff69fa3745512e54ad7a435fbed3d156908\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776321307 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776321307 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): add private collection fallback to owner action guards\n\nOwnerCollectionActions and OwnerEmptyStateFallback only checked\ngetPublicCollectionBySlug, so the owner''s edit/delete/add buttons\nwere invisible on private collections. Added the same public→owner\nfallback pattern used by OwnerItemActions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeCDIAAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrGj4AP0cX1Q26FRfe9NkhYTNzxgcl+BvlpakpzoEl27SuZExUAD+LK5mQxAvUYrl\nIRa834XP1ZFH1JNEmT