 check in collections.ts\n- Convert ReportProblem to client component to avoid blocking route error\n- Fix unicorn/no-null lint errors in ReportProblem\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e052c23e3a49a392cbe53e77fc2f898444e0f45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/trees/7e052c23e3a49a392cbe53e77fc2f898444e0f45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dezkareid/dezkareid/git/commits/ccb278f770ccb261bbbbbf143560ff0d7822805e","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e052c23e3a49a392cbe53e77fc2f898444e0f45\nparent e6ea3e684df3b3d6966bbb3412703eb9507317fc\nauthor Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776320500 -0600\ncommitter Joel Humberto Gomez Paredes <elmaildeldezkareid@gmail.com> 1776320500 -0600\n\nfix(collectstory): private collection page and report problem lint\n\n- Refactor collection page to separate static/dynamic rendering paths\n- CollectionContent renders cached public view (returns undefined on miss)\n- OwnerPrivateCollectionGuard streams in via Suspense for private collections\n- Page component shares public query result to avoid duplicate DB calls\n- Add eslint-disable comment for required null check in collections.ts\n- Convert ReportProblem to client component to avoid blocking route error\n- Fix unicorn/no-null lint errors in ReportProblem\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYIAB0WIQQL/mS43c4mCl2gjYb6fSll0wURrAUCaeB//QAKCRD6fSll0wUR\nrGi0AQDMjwUlL6RbbqNE2yoU5n0nspDW6mF/l11AQ2crRWrxtAEA6kdLU3rU4B09\nLwGOif2NOmLrbJCfDm0NPyiwuiHSbw4=\n=+uEC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-16T07:13:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1269896?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezkareid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users